window.SEARCH_INDEX = [{"t":"STRATA MUNDI WIKI OF KNOWLEDGEZ","u":"index.html","s":"HAI! HAI AN WELCUM 2 TEH STRATA MUNDI WIKI, \"TEH LAYRZ OV TEH WURLD\"! IT IZ A GAEM WIF BLOKZ 4 BILDIN AN EXPLORIN: AN INFINIT WURLD, MADE FROM A SEED, 4 U 2 WALK, DIG AN CHANGE HOW U WANT. 4 NAO (V0.1), U PLAI IN CRAYTIV MOAD : ALL TEH BLOKZ R RITE HERE, U CAN FLY, AN U BILD WIF NO LIMITZ. TEH WURLD [LORE 2 RITE] HOW 2 WALK AROUND TEH WIKI BLOKZ : ONE PAEG PER BLOK, WIF ITZ INFO BOX (ID, KIND, STUFFZ), WER 2 FIND IT AN WUT IT IZ 4. BIOMZ : TEH PLAECEZ OV TEH WURLD, DEIR GROUND AN DEIR PLANTZ. COMMANDZ : ALL TEH THINGZ TEH CONSOLE CAN DO. HOW STUFF WORKZ : WURLD MAKIN, SAEVIN, GAEM MOADZ. MOOVZ"},{"t":"NEW STUFFS","u":"news.html","s":"VERSHUN 0.2.1 (2026-11-13) GLOWY BOX — CAN ALSO HANG UNDR A BLOK, AN FALLZ IF U BREAK TEH BLOK. FIRE STIK — CAN ALSO STIK ON WALLZ, AN FALLZ IF U BREAK TEH WALL. WET STUFFZ — WATUR GOEZ TO TEH CLOSEST HOLE (4 BLOKZ MAX) INSTED OV SPREDDIN EVRYWAER; IT GOEZ 7 BLOKZ. NOIZEZ — ALL TEH NOIZEZ R REDY WEN LOADIN; U CAN HEER TEH HOT JUICE, TEH WINDZ R SOFTR; BAKGROUND NOIZEZ SLIDR. HOW TEH WORLD IZ MADE — BIOMZ 2 OR 3 TIMEZ BIGGR; HOT DRY BIOMZ NEVR TUCH SNOWY WONZ; RARE SKINNY BIG CRAKZ WIF BARE ROCK WALLZ. ALL TEH CHANGEZ"},{"t":"ALL TEH CHANGEZ","u":"changelog.html","s":"VERSHUN 0.2.1 (2026-11-13) GLOWY BOX — CAN ALSO HANG UNDR A BLOK, AN FALLZ IF U BREAK TEH BLOK. FIRE STIK — CAN ALSO STIK ON WALLZ, AN FALLZ IF U BREAK TEH WALL. WET STUFFZ — WATUR GOEZ TO TEH CLOSEST HOLE (4 BLOKZ MAX) INSTED OV SPREDDIN EVRYWAER; IT GOEZ 7 BLOKZ. NOIZEZ — ALL TEH NOIZEZ R REDY WEN LOADIN; U CAN HEER TEH HOT JUICE, TEH WINDZ R SOFTR; BAKGROUND NOIZEZ SLIDR. HOW TEH WORLD IZ MADE — BIOMZ 2 OR 3 TIMEZ BIGGR; HOT DRY BIOMZ NEVR TUCH SNOWY WONZ; RARE SKINNY BIG CRAKZ WIF BARE ROCK WALLZ. VERSHUN 0.2.0 (2026-11-11) STRIPY HILLZ — ADDED SANDZ SIDE — ADDED LOTZ OF WHITE TREEZ — ADDE"},{"t":"FLAT TREE LEEFZ","u":"blocks/strata/acacia_leaves.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN OLIV GREEN LEEFZ WIF SMOL HOLEZ. U SEE TEH SKY THRU. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give acacia_leaves . IN TEH WURLD, DEY R TEH HAT OV FLAT TREEZ IN SAVANUZ . WUT IZ 4 HEDGEZ, GREEN ROOFZ, GARDNZ AN TREE HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK BUT SEE-THRU . 4 NAO, LEEFZ NO FALL WHEN U CUT TEH TRUNK. PRO TIPZ U SEE DA COLOR FROM FAR. GUD 4 FINDIN FLAT TREEZ FROM A HILL. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A TREE HAT 2 REED ITZ NAEM, OR SEARCH \"LEEFZ\" IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX. WER IT SPAWNZ IN TEH PLANTZ: HOT GRAS , TOASTY MOUNTINZ HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"FLAT TREE LOG","u":"blocks/strata/acacia_log.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A FLAT TREE TRUNK WIF SMOOVE GRAY BARK, AN BRITE ORANJ CIRCLEZ AT TEH ENDZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give acacia_log . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH TRUNK OV FLAT TREEZ IN SAVANUZ : TRUNK LEENZ 2 1 SIDE, DEN FLAT WIDE HAT LIEK UMBRELLA. WUT IZ 4 BEEMZ, PILLARZ, ROOF STUFFZ AN CABINZ, IN A NEW COLOR. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. LIEK ALL LOGZ, IT TURNZ : ON TOP OR BOTTUM IT STANDZ UP, ON TEH SIDE IT LIEZ DOWN TEH WAY U CLIKD. PRO TIPZ MIX IT WIF OTHR WOODZ 4 PRETTY WALLZ. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A TRUNK 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. MI"},{"t":"FLAT TREE PLANKZ","u":"blocks/strata/acacia_planks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN FLAT TREE PLANKZ ALL IN A ROW. BRITE ORANJ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN TAB, OR /give acacia_planks . NOT IN TEH WURLD: IZ 4 BILDIN. WUT IZ 4 FLOORZ, WALLZ, ROOF STUFFZ. NEW COLOR, NOT LIEK OAK OR POINTY TREE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. PRO TIPZ FLOOR WIF 2 WOODZ = FANCY ROOM. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT SEARCH \"PLANKZ\" IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"BOTTUM ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/bedrock.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN BOTTUM ROCK IZ TEH FLOOR OV TEH WURLD. BUMPY, DARK, STUBBORN LAYR AT TEH VERY BOTTUM SO NOTHIN FALLZ OUT. LIEK A KITTEH WHO WONT MOOV OFF TEH KEYBORD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give bedrock . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ AT TEH BOTTUM OV EVRY COLUMN: ONE FULL ROW, PLUS SUM RANDUM BLOKZ ON TOP SO IT IZ BUMPY. DARK HOLEZ NEVR DIG IN2 IT. WUT IZ 4 IN CRAYTIV, A FANCEH DECORASHUN BLOK. IN SURVIVL, IT WILL B TEH END: NOBODY GOEZ UNDR. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. NO BREAKIN IF U IZ NOT IN CRAYTIV. IN CRAYTIV, UR SUPR CLIK BREAKZ IT LIEK"},{"t":"WHITE TREE LEEFZ","u":"blocks/strata/birch_leaves.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SOFT GREEN LEEFZ WIF SMOL HOLEZ. U SEE TEH SKY THRU. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give birch_leaves . IN TEH WURLD, DEY R TEH HAT OV WHITE TREEZ IN LOTZ OF TREEZ , WIF TEH OAKZ (AN SOON IN WHITE TREE FORESTZ). WUT IZ 4 HEDGEZ, GREEN ROOFZ, GARDNZ AN TREE HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK BUT SEE-THRU . 4 NAO, LEEFZ NO FALL WHEN U CUT TEH TRUNK. PRO TIPZ U SEE DA COLOR FROM FAR. GUD 4 FINDIN WHITE TREEZ FROM A HILL. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A TREE HAT 2 REED ITZ NAEM, OR SEARCH \"LEEFZ\" IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX. WER IT SPAWNZ IN TEH PLANTZ: LOTZ OF WHITE TREEZ , FLOWR"},{"t":"WHITE TREE LOG","u":"blocks/strata/birch_log.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A WHITE TREE TRUNK WIF WHITE BARK AN BLAK STRIPEZ, AN PALE LIEK CREEM CIRCLEZ AT TEH ENDZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give birch_log . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH TRUNK OV WHITE TREEZ IN LOTZ OF TREEZ , WIF TEH OAKZ (AN SOON IN WHITE TREE FORESTZ): TALL AN SKINNY, SMOL ROUND HAT. WUT IZ 4 BEEMZ, PILLARZ, ROOF STUFFZ AN CABINZ, IN A NEW COLOR. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. LIEK ALL LOGZ, IT TURNZ : ON TOP OR BOTTUM IT STANDZ UP, ON TEH SIDE IT LIEZ DOWN TEH WAY U CLIKD. PRO TIPZ MIX IT WIF OTHR WOODZ 4 PRETTY WALLZ. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LO"},{"t":"WHITE TREE PLANKZ","u":"blocks/strata/birch_planks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WHITE TREE PLANKZ ALL IN A ROW. PALE LIEK CREEM. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN TAB, OR /give birch_planks . NOT IN TEH WURLD: IZ 4 BILDIN. WUT IZ 4 FLOORZ, WALLZ, ROOF STUFFZ. NEW COLOR, NOT LIEK OAK OR POINTY TREE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. PRO TIPZ FLOOR WIF 2 WOODZ = FANCY ROOM. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT SEARCH \"PLANKZ\" IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"BUKSHELF","u":"blocks/strata/bookshelf.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WOOD PLANKZ FULL OV PRETTY BUKZ. STACKD, BUKSHELFS HOLD HANDZ : TEH EDGEZ GO AWAY AN DEY MAEK 1 BIG FURNICHUR. HOW 2 GETZ IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, BILDIN TAB. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK WIF PLANKZ ON TOP AN BOTTOM. ITZ SIDEZ CHANGE WIF TEH BUKSHELFS ABUV AN BELOW (HOLDIN HANDZ PIKCHUR). IT BURNZ : HOT FIRE NOMZ IT FAST. PRO TIPZ TEH \"DIFFRNT PIKCHURS\" SETTIN STOPZ TEH HAND HOLDIN IF U LIEK SEPRATE BLOKZ. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT STACK 3 BUKSHELFS: TEH FURNICHUR IZ DRAWN IN 1 PIECE. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"BROWN SHROOM","u":"blocks/strata/brown_mushroom.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A LIL BROWN SHROOM WIF A FLAT HAT. SHY. LIVEZ NEAR TREEZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give brown_mushroom . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN LIL GROUPZ IN LOTZ OF TREEZ (MOAR COMMON DAN RED SHROOM). WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT"},{"t":"BROWN SHROOM BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/brown_mushroom_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A PIECE OV A HUEG BROWN SHROOM HAT. WIDE AN FLAT LIEK A TABUL. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give brown_mushroom_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH FLAT HAT OV HUEG BROWN SHROOMZ, IN HUEG SHROOM LANDZ. WUT IZ 4 FLAT ROOFZ, PLATFORMZ, HUEG PICNIC TABULZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, SOFT: BREAKZ FAST. PRO TIPZ ON TOP OV A BROWN SHROOM, U SEE EVRYTHIN. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A HUEG SHROOM HAT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. WER IT SPAWNZ IN TEH PLANTZ: SHROOM LANDZ HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"BUSH","u":"blocks/strata/bush.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A ROUND LEEFY BUSH. AS TALL AS A SITTIN KITTEH. PERFECT 4 HIDIN (IF U R A KITTEH). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give bush . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ ALONE OR 2 IN FLAT GRAS AN LOTZ OF TREEZ , ON GRAS. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FIN"},{"t":"POKEY PLANT","u":"blocks/strata/cactus.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN POKEY PLANT, TEH SPIKEY KING OV HOT SANDZ. GREEN, STRIPEY, FULL OV POKEZ. IT STANDZ UP STRAIT AN NEVR ASKZ 4 WATUR. BEST ROOMMATE. DO NOT HUG. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give cactus . IN TEH WURLD, IT ONLY GROWZ IN HOT SANDZ, ON SANDZ , AS LIL TOWRZ OV A FEW BLOKZ, ALL OVR TEH DUNEZ. WUT IZ 4 HOT SANDZ DECORASHUN, DRY GARDNZ, SCARY FENCEZ (THEY LOOK SCARY, AT LEEST). HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO IT NO POKEZ : OWIEZ COME WIF SURVIVL. IT NO GROWZ AFTR TEH WURLD IZ MADE, AN IN CRAYTIV U CAN PUT IT ON ANY SOLID BLOK. PRO TIPZ POKEY P"},{"t":"COAL IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/coal_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GRAY ROCK WIF BLAK SPOTZ: COAL. IT IZ TEH MOST COMMON IN TEH ROCK STUFF IN TEH WURLD. U BUMP IN2 IT IN EVRY DARK HOLE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give coal_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ LIL ROCK STRIPEZ IN ROCK, FROM VERY DEEP 2 HIGH IN TEH BIG ROCKZ, WER SUMTIMEZ U SEE IT IN TEH OPEN AIR. IN DEEP ROCK, IT BECOMEZ COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK. WUT IZ 4 4 NAO, A PRETTY DECORASHUN BLOK 4 ROCK WALLZ. IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, U BREAK IT AN IT IZ JUS GONE. IT WILL B A REAL THING WEN SURVIVL COMEZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SE"},{"t":"COPPR IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/copper_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK WIF LIL ORANJ COPPR BITZ DAT GO SHINY IN TEH LITE. COPPR IZ IRONZ WARM COUSIN: MOAR FLASHY, ALMOST AS COMMON. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give copper_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ LIL ROCK STRIPEZ IN ROCK, HALFWAY DOWN UNDR TEH FLAT GRAS AN HILLZ. ALSO LOTZ OV IT IN BIG ROCK STASHEZ OV GREEN RUSTY ROCK. IN DEEP ROCK, IT BECOMEZ COPPR IN TEH DEEP ROCK. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO: IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET , AN IN CRAYTIV U BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. ROCK FAMLY. PRO TIPZ GREEN ROCKZ IN"},{"t":"BLU FLOWR","u":"blocks/strata/cornflower.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A BLU FLOWR SHAPED LIEK A STAR. VERY BLU. MUCH WOW. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give cornflower . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN FLOWR PATCHEZ OV TEH FLAT GRAS . WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH "},{"t":"WHITE FLOWR","u":"blocks/strata/daisy.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A LIL WHITE FLOWR WIF A YELLO MIDDUL. GROWZ WERE TEH GRAS IZ SOFT. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give daisy . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN FLOWR PATCHEZ OV TEH FLAT GRAS . WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NA"},{"t":"YELLO FLOWR","u":"blocks/strata/dandelion.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A SUNNY YELLO FLOWR. MOST COMMON FLOWR. IT SMILEZ AT U. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give dandelion . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN FLOWR PATCHEZ OV TEH FLAT GRAS (MOST COMMON, WIF TEH RED FLOWR). WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT"},{"t":"DED BUSH","u":"blocks/strata/dead_bush.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A LIL DRY BUSH WIF TWISTY STIKZ. NO LEEFZ. STILL HAPPY IN TEH SAND. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give dead_bush . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ HERE AN THERE IN TEH HOT SANDY PLACE , ON SAND. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT"},{"t":"COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_coal_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN TEH DEEP VERSHUN OV COAL IN TEH ROCK: BLAK SPOTZ IN DEEP ROCK, DARK ON DARK. U NEED KITTEH EYEZ 2 SEE IT, BUT IT IZ DERE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_coal_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT SHOWZ INSTED OV COAL IN TEH ROCK WEN A ROCK STRIPE GOEZ THRU DEEP ROCK, SO DEEP DOWN IN EVRY BIOM. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO. LIEK ALL IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ, IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN ITZ COUSIN UP TOP (WILL MATTR IN SURVIVL). PRO TIPZ A ROCK STRIPE CAN "},{"t":"COPPR IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_copper_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DEEP ROCK, DARK AN HEVY, WIF TEH SAEM COPPR BITZ AS COPPR IN TEH ROCK. EZ 2 SEE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_copper_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ COPPR WER ROCK BECOMEZ DEEP ROCK, IN LIL ROCK STRIPEZ AN AT TEH BOTTUM OV BIG ROCK STASHEZ. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO: IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET . HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. HARDR DAN NORMAL COPPR IN TEH ROCK. PRO TIPZ BIG ROCK STASHEZ DAT GO REELY DEEP CHANJ COLOR. FOLLOW TEH STRIPE. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. F3 SHOWZ U WENT R"},{"t":"SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_diamond_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SKY-BLU CRISTALZ IN DEEP ROCK, SHININ LIEK STARZ IN A SUPR DARK SKY. DIS IZ HOW SHINY REELY SHOWZ UP IN TEH WURLD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_diamond_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ AT TEH VERY BOTTUM, RITE ABOVE BOTTUM ROCK, IN TEENY AN SUPR RARE STRIPEZ. WIF TEH BASIC PAK, ALL TEH SHINY PLAEC IZ DEEP ROCK: SO DIS IZ TEH ONE U FINDZ WEN U EXPLOR. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO, TEH FANCIEST OV ALL. IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN NORMAL SHI"},{"t":"GOLD IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_gold_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GOLD IN DEEP ROCK: YELLO NUGGETZ DAT SHINE EVEN MOAR ON TEH DARK. A LIL TREZHUR FROM DEEP DOWN. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_gold_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT REPLAECEZ GOLD IN TEH ROCK WEN A ROCK STRIPE GOEZ THRU DEEP ROCK. DIS IZ HOW U SEE GOLD MOST OFTEN. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO. IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN NORMAL GOLD IN TEH ROCK (WILL MATTR IN SURVIVL). PRO TIPZ GOLD ON DARK ROCK IZ EZ 2 SEE. BRING A TORCH… OOPS, NO LITE YET. J"},{"t":"IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_iron_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN IRON FROM DEEP DOWN: RUSTY BITZ ON DEEP ROCK. HARDR 2 SEE DAN ITZ ROCK COUSIN, BUT JUS AS GUD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_iron_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT REPLAECEZ IRON IN TEH ROCK WEN A ROCK STRIPE GOEZ THRU DEEP ROCK, DEEP DOWN IN EVRY BIOM. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO. IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN NORMAL IRON IN TEH ROCK (WILL MATTR IN SURVIVL). PRO TIPZ IN DEEP DARK HOLEZ, IRON IZ EVRYWER. IF U HUNT 4 SHINY, U WILL SEE LOTZ OV IR"},{"t":"DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_stone.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DARKR AN HEAVIER DAN NORMAL ROCK, DEEP ROCK SEZ U IZ REELY FAR UNDR TEH GRAS. IT LOOKZ GRUMPEH. DAT IZ CUZ IT CARRIEZ TEH WHOLE WURLD ON ITZ BAK. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_stone . IN TEH WURLD, IT REPLAECEZ ROCK BELOW SUM DEEPNESS, IN EVRY BIOM. TEH LINE IZ NOT FLAT, IT WOBBLEZ A FEW BLOKZ. EVEN DEEPR IZ BOTTUM ROCK. WUT IZ 4 DARK BILDINZ, BASEMENT FLOORZ, MAKIN PRETTY STRIPEZ WIF NORMAL ROCK. ALSO TEH DEEP IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ LIVE IN IT. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. IT IZ HARDR DAN ROCK. IN CRAYTIV NOBODY CAREZ ("},{"t":"SHINY IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/diamond_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK WIF SPARKLY SKY-BLU CRISTALZ: SHINY! TEH RAREZ AN MOST WANTED IN TEH ROCK STUFF. FINDIN IT IZ LIEK FINDIN A CHEEZBURGER UNDRGROUND. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give diamond_ore . IN TEH WURLD, SHINY IZ ONLY AT TEH VERY BOTTUM, RITE ABOVE BOTTUM ROCK, IN TEENY STRIPEZ. WIF TEH BASIC PAK, ALL DAT PLAEC IZ DEEP ROCK: SO U ALMOST ALWAYZ SEE SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK , AN RARELY (MAYBE NEVR) DIS ROCK VERSHUN. IT IZ STILL HERE 4 BILDIN AN 4 PAKZ DAT CHANGE TEH WURLD LAYRZ. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO, PERFECT 4 A KITTEH THRONE OR A TREZHUR ROOM. I"},{"t":"DIRTZ","u":"blocks/strata/dirt.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GUD OLD DIRTZ: BROWN, CRUMBLY, COMFY. IT HIDEZ UNDR TEH GRAS AN SMELLZ NICE AFTR RAIN (WELL, IT WILL, WEN RAIN EXISTZ). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give dirt . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ A LAYR OV A FEW BLOKZ UNDR TEH TOP OV FLAT GRAS, LOTZ OF TREEZ, BIG ROCKZ AN COLD FLAT LAND, BETWEEN GRAS AN ROCK. IT IZ ALSO TEH BOTTUM SIDE OV GRAS BLOKZ. WUT IZ 4 MAKIN HILLZ, MOVIN GROUND, FURST UGLY HOUSEZ. PUT IT ANYWER, TAEK IT OFF JUS AS FAST. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO, DIRTZ STAYZ DIRTZ: NO GRAS GROWZ BAK ON IT, EVEN IN SUNSHINE. "},{"t":"FERN","u":"blocks/strata/fern.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A FERN WIF LOTZ OV LIL LEEFZ. LIKEZ SHADE AN COLD. LOOKZ OLD. PROBABLY IZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give fern . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN LOTZ OF TREEZ , AN A FEW IN TEH COLD FLAT PLACE , ON GRAS (SNOWY OR NOT). WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WAL"},{"t":"RUSTY ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/ferrous_rock.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN RED-BROWN ROCK LIEK RUST, LIEK TEH ROCK STAYD IN TEH RAIN 4 EVR. IT IZ WUT BIG IRON STASHEZ R MADE OV. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give ferrous_rock . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ IN BIG IRON STASHEZ, RARE AN FULL OV IRON, LOTZ OV BLOKZ LONG UNDRGROUND. SUMTIMEZ A FEW BLOKZ POKE OUT ON TEH GROUND RITE ABOV. WUT IZ 4 BILDIN BLOK 4 NAO. WARM COLOR, NICE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. BIT HARDR DAN ROCK. PRO TIPZ RUSTY SPOT IN TEH GRAS IZ NEVR AN ACCIDENT: BIG IRON STASH IZ SLEEPIN UNDR. DIG STRAIT DOWN. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK 4 IT WE"},{"t":"POINTY TREE NEEDLZ","u":"blocks/strata/fir_leaves.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DARK GREEN POINTY TREE NEEDLZ, ALL SQUISHED 2GETHR. DEY SMELL LIEK WINTR AN MAEK TEH BIG ROCKZ LOOK LIEK A HOLIDAY CARD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give fir_leaves . IN TEH WURLD, DEY R TEH POINTY CONE HEAD OV POINTY TREEZ, ON BIG ROCKZ AN IN COLD FLAT LAND. WUT IZ 4 HOMEMADE HOLIDAY TREEZ (KITTEH WILL CLIMB IT), ALWAYZ-GREEN HEDJEZ, MOUNTIN HOUSE ROOFZ, FAKE ALPZ FORESTZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BUT SEE-THRU HOLEZ : U SEE THRU TEH SPACEZ, EVEN OTHR NEEDLZ BEHIND. LIEK OAK LEEFZ, NO FALLZ WEN U CUT TEH TRUNK, AN U CAN WALK ON DEM. PRO TIPZ 4 A RE"},{"t":"POINTY TREE LOG","u":"blocks/strata/fir_log.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A POINTY TREE TRUNK, DARKR AN SKINNIER DAN OAK, WIF DEEP LINEZ IN TEH BARK. IT LIVED ALL ITZ LIFE IN TEH COLD AN U CAN TELL: DIS LOG HAZ ATTITUDE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give fir_log . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH TRUNK OV POINTY TREEZ, ON TEH SIDEZ OV BIG ROCKZ AN, LESS OFTEN, IN COLD FLAT LAND. DEY GROW ON GRAS BLOKZ, SNOWY OR NOT. WUT IZ 4 MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, COZY CABINZ, DARK BEEMZ DAT LOOK GUD WIF LITE PLANKZ. LYIN DOWN, IT MAEKZ NICE RAILZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. LIEK ALL LOGZ, IT TURNZ : STANDZ UP ON TEH TOP OR BOTTUM OV A BL"},{"t":"POINTY TREE PLANKZ","u":"blocks/strata/fir_planks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DARK BROWN POINTY TREE PLANKZ WIF TIGHT LINEZ. DEY SMELL LIEK TREE SAP AN MOUNTIN HOUSEZ. DARKR DAN OAK PLANKZ, DEY GIVE ATTITUDE 2 ANY ROOM. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give fir_planks . DEY NOT IN NATURE. TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX IZ TEH ONLY WAY UNTIL CRAFTIN COMEZ. WUT IZ 4 MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, PRETEND LIBRAREEZ, BOATZ DAT NEVR LEEV, DARK ROOF BEEMZ. LOOKZ GUD WIF ROCK AN SANDZ ROCK. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. LIEK OAK PLANKZ, NO BURNZ AN NO ROTZ 4 NAO. PRO TIPZ POINTY TREE PLANKZ ROOF ON ROCK WALLZ = PERFECT MOUNTIN HOUSE. BILD I"},{"t":"HOT FIRE","u":"blocks/strata/fire.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN HAPPY DANCIN FLAEMZ ABUV TEH GROUND. HOT FIRE GIVEZ AZ MUCH LITE AZ GLOWY ROCK, MAEKZ EVRYTHIN COZY… AN NOMZ WOOD. HOW 2 GETZ NO ITEM 4 IT: LITE IT WIF SPARKY ROKZ (TOOLZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX), RITE CLICK ON A SIDE. HOW IT ACTZ GIVEZ LITE LEVUL 15 . NOT SOLID: U WALK THRU IT, AN PUTTIN A BLOK THAR REMOOVZ IT. IT SITZ ON A SOLID BLOK OR NEXT 2 A BURNY BLOK, NEVR NEXT 2 WATUR. IT GETZ OLD : WIF NUTHIN 2 BURN, IT GOEZ OUT SOON; ELSE IT JUMPZ 2 TEH LOGZ, PLANKZ, LEEFZ, GRAS AN FLOWRZ NEAR, AN NOMZ DEM. TEH \"HOT FIRE\" PAGE OV TEH HOW STUFF WERKZ TELLZ ALL. PRO TIPZ A BUKKIT OF WAT"},{"t":"SEE-THRU BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/glass.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A CLEER WINDOW WIF A THIN FRAEM. U LOOK AT TEH OUTSIDE AN DONT GET COLD. PURRFECT 4 KITTEHZ WHO WATCH BIRDZ ALL DAY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give glass . IT NEVR SHOWZ IN NATURE: ONLY BILDERZ MAEK IT. WUT IZ 4 WINDOWZ, GLASS ROOFZ, PLANT HOUSEZ, FISHIE TANKZ, UNDR-WATUR LOOKIN ROOMZ. ANYTHIN DAT WANTZ 2 SEE OUTSIDE (OR INSIDE). HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK, ALL SEE-THRU : ONLY TEH FRAEM IZ DRAWED. U CAN WALK ON IT. 2 SEE-THRU BLOKZ NEXT 2 EACH OTHR NO MERJ IN2 ONE BIG WINDOW YET: EACH ONE KEEPZ ITZ FRAEM. PRO TIPZ SEE-THRU BLOK + WATUR DAT NO M"},{"t":"GLOWY ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/glowstone.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A GOLDY ROCK FULL OV GLOWY BITZ, WARM 2 LOOK AT LIEK A FIREPLAEC. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give glowstone . NOT IN NATURE YET. WUT IZ 4 GLOWY CEILINGZ, BRITE FLOORZ, LITE TOWERZ: WERRVR TEH LITE SHUD BE PART OV TEH WALL. HOW IT ACTZ FULL SOLID BLOK DAT GIVEZ LITE LEVUL 15 . LIEK ROCK, IT STOPZ OTHR LITE, BUT IT SHINEZ ITZ OWN ALL AROUND. PRO TIPZ PUT IT IN A CEILIN OR A FLOOR: LITE WIF NUTHIN STIKKIN OUT. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT IT WAITZ 4 U IN TEH BILDIN BLOKZ TAB. LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"GOLD IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/gold_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK WIF LIL SHINY YELLO NUGGETZ: GOLD! GOLD! TEH KIND OV BLOK DAT MAEKZ U SQUEEK LIEK A TOY MOUSE IN A DARK HOLE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give gold_ore . IN TEH WURLD, GOLD HIDEZ IN TEH LOWR HALF OV TEH WURLD, IN SMOLLR AN RAREZ STRIPEZ DAN IRON. ITZ PLAECEZ R MOSTLY IN DEEP ROCK, SO U SEE TEH DEEP KIND WAY MOAR. IN ROCK, IT ONLY SHOWZ IN A THIN LINE RITE ABOVE TEH DEEP LAYR. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO, AN SO PRETTY! IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ."},{"t":"GRAS BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/grass_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GRAS BLOK IZ TEH GREEN CARPIT OV TEH WURLD: NICE SHORT GRAS ON TOP, GREEN FRINJ ON TEH SIDEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. U LOOK AT IT AN U WANTS A PIKNIK. WIF CHEEZBURGERZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give grass_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT COVRZ TEH GROUND OV FLAT GRAS, LOTZ OF TREEZ AN BIG ROCKZ, UNTIL TEH ROCK AN SNOW OV TEH TOPZ TAEK OVR. NEXT 2 WATUR, IT BECOMEZ SANDZ OR CRUNCHY ROCKZ. WUT IZ 4 GARDNZ, LAWNZ, GREEN ROOFZ. OAK AN POINTY TREEZ GROW ON IT WEN TEH WURLD IZ MADE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, DIFFRENT PIKCHURZ ON TOP, SIDEZ AN BOTTUM. 4 "},{"t":"CRUNCHY ROCKZ","u":"blocks/strata/gravel.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A HAPPEH PILE OV TEENY PEBBULZ, GRAY AN BEIJ AN BROWN. CRUNCHY ROCKZ NEVR MANAGED 2 BECOME ROCK, BUT IT STAYED HAPPEH. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give gravel . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH FLOOR OV BIG WATUR, AN TEH SHOREZ AN SHALLO WATUR NEXT 2 LOTZ OF TREEZ, BIG ROCKZ AN COLD FLAT LAND. WUT IZ 4 GARDN PATHZ, MOUNTIN TRAILZ, RIVR SIDEZ. MAEKZ EVRYTHIN LOOK NATURAL AN A BIT FARMEH. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. LIEK SANDZ, IT NO FALLZ YET : UNTIL GRAVITEE COMEZ, IT STAYZ WER U PUT IT, EVEN OVR NOTHIN. PRO TIPZ GO 2 BIG WATUR: TEH FLOOR IZ "},{"t":"COLD WATUR BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/ice.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WATUR DAT GOT 2 COLD. COLD WATUR BLOK IZ BLU AN KINDA SEE-THRU, U CAN SEE WUT IZ UNDR. LIEK A WINDOW ON TEH LAEK. FISHIEZ? NO FISHIEZ YET. SAD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give ice . IN TEH WURLD, IT COVRZ TEH WATUR OV COLD FLAT LAND: ONE LAYR, AT WATUR LINE, WIF REAL WATUR RITE UNDR. WUT IZ 4 SKATIN PLAECEZ (NO SLIDIN YET), FROSTY WINDOWZ, SNOW CASTLEZ. ALSO A FREE BRIDJ 2 WALK ON FROZEN LAEKZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK, KINDA SEE-THRU : U SEE THRU IT, A BIT BLU. SAFE 2 WALK ON. NO MELTZ AN NO SLIPPEH 4 PAWZ, BUT FLOATEEZ SLIDE ON IT ALMOST 4E"},{"t":"IRON IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/iron_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK WIF LIL RUSTY AN BEIJ BITZ: IRON. QUIET BUT EVRYWER. IT IZ TEH SERIUS ONE OV TEH GANG. IT WILL GO FAR. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give iron_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ LIL ROCK STRIPEZ IN ROCK, FROM DEEP DOWN 2 PRETTY HIGH UNDR TEH HILLZ. A BIT LESS COMMON DAN COAL. IN DEEP ROCK, IT BECOMEZ IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO: IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET , AN IN CRAYTIV U BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. IT GETZ IMPORTANT WEN SURVIVL COMEZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. ROCK FAMLY. PRO TIPZ LONG DARK HOL"},{"t":"JUNGUL LEEFZ","u":"blocks/strata/jungle_leaves.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DEEP GREEN LEEFZ WIF SMOL HOLEZ. U SEE TEH SKY THRU. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give jungle_leaves . IN TEH WURLD, DEY R TEH HAT OV JUNGULZ IN JUNGULZ . WUT IZ 4 HEDGEZ, GREEN ROOFZ, GARDNZ AN TREE HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK BUT SEE-THRU . 4 NAO, LEEFZ NO FALL WHEN U CUT TEH TRUNK. PRO TIPZ U SEE DA COLOR FROM FAR. GUD 4 FINDIN JUNGULZ FROM A HILL. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A TREE HAT 2 REED ITZ NAEM, OR SEARCH \"LEEFZ\" IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX. WER IT SPAWNZ IN TEH PLANTZ: JUNGUL HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"JUNGUL LOG","u":"blocks/strata/jungle_log.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A JUNGUL TRUNK WIF RUFF GREENY-BROWN BARK, AN WARM AN PINKY CIRCLEZ AT TEH ENDZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give jungle_log . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH TRUNK OV JUNGULZ IN JUNGULZ : SUPR BIG, TRUNK 2 BY 2 AN ALMOST 30 BLOKZ TALL, HUEG HAT WIF DANGLY ROPEZ. WUT IZ 4 BEEMZ, PILLARZ, ROOF STUFFZ AN CABINZ, IN A NEW COLOR. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. LIEK ALL LOGZ, IT TURNZ : ON TOP OR BOTTUM IT STANDZ UP, ON TEH SIDE IT LIEZ DOWN TEH WAY U CLIKD. PRO TIPZ MIX IT WIF OTHR WOODZ 4 PRETTY WALLZ. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A TRUNK 2 REED I"},{"t":"JUNGUL PLANKZ","u":"blocks/strata/jungle_planks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN JUNGUL PLANKZ ALL IN A ROW. WARM AN PINKY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN TAB, OR /give jungle_planks . NOT IN TEH WURLD: IZ 4 BILDIN. WUT IZ 4 FLOORZ, WALLZ, ROOF STUFFZ. NEW COLOR, NOT LIEK OAK OR POINTY TREE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. PRO TIPZ FLOOR WIF 2 WOODZ = FANCY ROOM. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT SEARCH \"PLANKZ\" IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"GLOWY BOX","u":"blocks/strata/lantern.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A TINY IRON CAGE WIF A GOLDY HART DAT GLOWZ AN NO WOBBLEZ. STRONGR AN BRITR DAN FIRE STIK. HOUSEZ FEEL ALL COZY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give lantern . NOT IN NATURE. WUT IZ 4 LITE 4 HOUSEZ, PLAECZ AN BRIJEZ, WEN A FIRE STIK IZ 2 SMOL. HOW IT ACTZ GIVEZ TEH MOST LITE, LEVUL 15 , 1 LESS EVRY BLOK. IT IZ NOT SOLID. IT SITZ ON A SOLID BLOK OR HANGZ UNDR A BLOK ON ITZ TINY CHAYN, DEPENDZ WICH SIDE U LOOK AT. TAEK TEH FLOOR OR ROOF DAT HOLDZ IT AN TEH GLOWY BOX FALLZ. PRO TIPZ GLOWY BOX GOEZ A BIT FARR DAN FIRE STIK: GUD IN TEH MIDDL OV A BIG "},{"t":"HOT JUICE","u":"blocks/strata/lava.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN HOT ORANJ ROCK JUICE DAT SLEEPZ AT TEH BOTTOM OV TEH WURLD. IT MAEKZ PRETTY LAEKZ UNDR TEH GROUND… LOOK FROM FAR AWAY PLZ. KITTEH NO LIEK HOT PAWZ. HOW 2 GETZ HOT JUICE HAZ NO ITEM OV ITZ OWN : IN CREATIF, TEH BUKKIT OF HOT JUICE (TOOLZ TAB) PUTZ A SAUCE, AN TEH EMPTY BUKKIT TAEKZ IT BAK. IN TEH WURLD, IT FILLZ TEH DARK HOLEZ AN BIG DARK HOLEZ AN BIG CRACKZ WAI DOWN, NEAR TEH BOTTUM ROCK, IN FLAT LAEKZ. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY STUFFZ IN TEH DEEP, AN LANDMARK: WEN U SEE IT, TEH BOTTUM ROCK IZ NOT FAR. HOW IT ACTZ HOT JUICE FLOWZ , BUT SLOW (1 BLOK EVRY 1.5 SECONDZ) AN NOT FAR: 3 BLOKZ ON FL"},{"t":"PURPL SMELLY FLOWR","u":"blocks/strata/lavender.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN PURPL FLOWR STIKZ. U CAN IMAGIN TEH NICE SMELL (NO SMELL IN GAEM, SRY). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give lavender . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN FLOWR PATCHEZ OV TEH FLAT GRAS , MOAR RARE DAN OTHR FLOWRZ. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH"},{"t":"SQUISHY DIRTZ","u":"blocks/strata/mud.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DARK STICKY SQUISHY DIRTZ. GOEZ SQUELCH (WHEN SOUNDZ COME). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give mud . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ UNDR TEH WATUR IN STINKY WATUR. WUT IZ 4 SWAMP FLOORZ, WET GARDENZ, STIK HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, SOFT. PRO TIPZ WER SQUISHY DIRTZ STARTZ, SHALLO WATUR STARTZ. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. WER IT SPAWNZ UNDR WATR: STINKY WATUR HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"SHROOM LEG","u":"blocks/strata/mushroom_stem.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN TEH PALE LEG OV A HUEG SHROOM. SOFT LIEK WET BOX (BUT NICR). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give mushroom_stem . IN TEH WURLD, IT HOLDZ TEH HAT OV HUEG RED AN BROWN SHROOMZ. WUT IZ 4 PALE PILLARZ, SHROOM HOUSEZ, WEIRD FENCEZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, SOFT: BREAKZ FAST. PRO TIPZ PUT A RED OR BROWN HAT ON TOP: U HAZ UR OWN HUEG SHROOM. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT TEH LEG OV A HUEG SHROOM 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. WER IT SPAWNZ IN TEH PLANTZ: SHROOM LANDZ HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"SHROOM DIRTZ","u":"blocks/strata/mycelium.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DIRTZ WIF PURPL SHROOM FUZZ ON TOP. SOFT AN BIT MISTERIUS. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give mycelium . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ ON TEH RARE SHROOM LANDZ. WUT IZ 4 SHROOM GARDENZ, FAIRY FLOORZ, SHROOM HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. DIRTZ UNDR. PRO TIPZ HUEG AN TINY SHROOMZ LIEK 2 GROW ON IT. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. WER IT SPAWNZ ON TOP: SHROOM LANDZ HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"OAK LEEFZ","u":"blocks/strata/oak_leaves.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN FLUFFY GREEN OAK LEEFZ, FULL OV LIL HOLEZ 2 SEE TEH SKY. PERFECT 4 A NAP IN TEH SHADE (PRETEND SHADE, UNTIL LITE COMEZ). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give oak_leaves . IN TEH WURLD, DEY R TEH ROUND HEAD OV OAK TREEZ, IN FLAT GRAS AN LOTZ OF TREEZ. WUT IZ 4 HEDJEZ, BUSHEZ, GREEN ROOFZ, GARDN MAZEZ, SEKRIT TREE HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BUT SEE-THRU HOLEZ : U SEE THRU TEH LEEFZ, EVEN OTHR LEEFZ BEHIND. 4 NAO LEEFZ NO FALLZ WEN U CUT TEH TRUNK: A TREE WIF NO LOG KEEPZ ITZ HEAD FLOATIN. VERY PROUD. U CAN WALK ON DEM 2. PRO TIPZ PUT OAK LEEFZ IN A"},{"t":"OAK LOG","u":"blocks/strata/oak_log.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A NICE OAK TRUNK WIF RUFF BROWN BARK AN CIRCLEZ AT TEH ENDZ. IT SMELLZ LIEK FOREST AN TREE HOUSEZ. ALSO GR8 4 SCRATCHIN. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give oak_log . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH TRUNK OV OAK TREEZ: A FEW IN FLAT GRAS, LOTZ IN LOTZ OF TREEZ. OAKZ ONLY GROW ON GRAS BLOKZ. WUT IZ 4 BEEMZ, PILLARZ, ROOF STUFFZ, WINDOW FRAEMZ, CABINZ. LYIN DOWN, IT MAEKZ GR8 BENCHEZ 4 NAPPIN. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. TEH LOG TURNZ : PUT ON TEH TOP OR BOTTUM OV A BLOK, IT STANDZ UP. PUT ON TEH SIDE OV A BLOK, IT LIEZ DOWN THE WAY OV TEH SIDE U"},{"t":"OAK PLANKZ","u":"blocks/strata/oak_planks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN OAK PLANKZ, WARM GOLDY BROWN, SMOOF, WIF NICE LINEZ. TEH BEST WOOD 4 BILDIN. U ALREDDY WANT 2 PUT A RUG ON DEM AN NAP. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give oak_planks . DEY NOT IN NATURE. UNTIL CRAFTIN COMEZ, TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX IZ TEH ONLY WAY. WUT IZ 4 FLOORZ, WALLZ, ROOFZ, PRETEND FURNICHUR, COZY HOUSEZ. WIF OAK LOGZ, U GETZ A CUTE COTTAGE RITE AWAY. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO NO BURNZ AN NO ROTZ: UR WOOD HOUSEZ R SAFE FROM EVRYTHIN EGZEPT U. PRO TIPZ MIX OAK PLANKZ AN POINTY TREE PLANKZ 4 FANCEH FLOORZ. LITE-DARK-LITE"},{"t":"SHINY DARK ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/obsidian.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SHINY PURPUL-BLAK ROCK, BORNED WEN WATUR MEETZ HOT JUICE. SUPR HARD, IT GLOWZ A LIL WEN TEH LITE TOUCHEZ IT. HOW 2 GETZ POUR WATUR ON A HOT JUICE SAUCE (OR LET WATUR FLOW 2 IT): TEH HOT JUICE BECOMEZ SHINY DARK ROCK. ALSO IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX (NATURE STUFFZ TAB). WUT IZ 4 BILDIN AN DARK PRETTY STUFFZ. ITZ BIG HARDNESS WILL MATTR WEN DIGGIN TAEKZ TIEM (v0.3). HOW IT ACTZ FULL SOLID BLOK, LIEK ROCK. NO FLOWZ, NO MELTZ. PRO TIPZ 2 STOP A HOT JUICE LAEK, LET WATUR FLOW ON TOP: SAUCEZ BECOMEZ SHINY DARK ROCK, FLOWIN HOT JUICE BECOMEZ ROCK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT U SEE WATUR MEET HOT JUI"},{"t":"ORANJ CRUNCHY CLAY","u":"blocks/strata/orange_terracotta.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ORANJ CRUNCHY CLAY, BAKED BY TEH SUN 4 AGEZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give orange_terracotta . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ STRIPEZ IN STRIPY HILLZ. WUT IZ 4 WARM COLOR WALLZ AN PATTURNZ. WIF ITZ COLOR COUZINZ, BIG PALETT 4 BILDIN. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, BIT HARDR DAN DIRTZ. PRO TIPZ EACH COLOR STAYZ AT TEH SAEM HEIGHT: FOLLOW TEH STRIPE. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A STRIPE 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"NEEDLE DIRTZ","u":"blocks/strata/podzol.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN BROWN DIRTZ WIF POINTY TREE NEEDLEZ. SMELLZ LIEK COLD FOREST. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give podzol . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH GROUND OV LOTZ OF POINTY TREEZ. WUT IZ 4 FOREST FLOORZ, PATHZ, COZY GARDENZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, DIRTZ UNDR. POINTY TREEZ, FERNZ AN SHROOMZ GROW ON IT. PRO TIPZ BROWN GROUND + POINTY TREEZ = U R IN LOTZ OF POINTY TREEZ. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. WER IT SPAWNZ ON TOP: LOTZ OF POINTY TREEZ HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"RED FLOWR","u":"blocks/strata/poppy.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A RED FLOWR WIF A DARK MIDDUL. MAEKZ TEH GRAS LOOK SPOTTY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give poppy . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN FLOWR PATCHEZ OV TEH FLAT GRAS , WIF OTHR FLOWRZ. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 RE"},{"t":"PRETEND DOOR 2 NOWHERE","u":"blocks/strata/portal.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A PURPL CURTAIN DAT SWIRLZ SLOWLY AN GLOWZ IN TEH DARK. DIS PRETEND DOOR 2 NOWHERE IZ JUS 4 PRETTY: IT GOEZ NOWHERE (4 NAO). HOW 2 GETZ IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, BILDIN TAB. HOW IT ACTZ GIVEZ LITE LEVUL 11 . U WALK THRU IT AN SEE THRU IT. ITZ PIKCHUR WIGGLEZ ; TEH \"WIGGLY PIKCHURS\" SETTIN MAEKZ IT STOP. PRO TIPZ MANY DOORZ NEXT 2 EACH OTHR MAEK 1 BIG CURTAIN: TEH SHARED SIDEZ R NOT DRAWN. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT PUT 1 IN A DARK CAEV AN WATCH TEH PURPL SHINY ON TEH ROKZ. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"RED SHROOM","u":"blocks/strata/red_mushroom.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A RED SHROOM WIF WHITE DOTZ. PRETTY 2 LOOK AT. MAYBE NO EAT. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give red_mushroom . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN LIL GROUPZ IN LOTZ OF TREEZ , WIF BROWN SHROOMZ. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN STILL WALK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT"},{"t":"RED SHROOM BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/red_mushroom_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A PIECE OV A HUEG SHROOM HAT. RED WIF WHITE DOTZ. KITTEH WANTZ 2 SIT UNDR. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give red_mushroom_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH ROUND HAT OV HUEG RED SHROOMZ, IN HUEG SHROOM LANDZ. WUT IZ 4 ROUND ROOFZ, TINY PEEPL HOUSEZ, LOUD GARDN STUFFZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, SOFT: BREAKZ FAST. PRO TIPZ PUT IT ON SHROOM LEGZ 2 MAEK UR OWN HUEG SHROOM. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A HUEG SHROOM HAT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. WER IT SPAWNZ IN TEH PLANTZ: SHROOM LANDZ HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"RED SANDZ","u":"blocks/strata/red_sand.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN RED-ORANJ SANDZ, WARM FROM TEH SUN. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give red_sand . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ ON TEH FLAT TOPZ OV STRIPY HILLZ. WUT IZ 4 COLOR DESERTZ, PATHZ, SPACE GARDENZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. NO FALL YET. PRO TIPZ DIG A BIT: CRUNCHY CLAY STRIPEZ R UNDR. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. WER IT SPAWNZ ON MOUNTIN TOPZ: TOASTY MOUNTINZ UNDR TEH TOP: STRIPY HILLZ ON TOP: STRIPY HILLZ UNDR WATR: STRIPY HILLZ HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"RED CRUNCHY CLAY","u":"blocks/strata/red_terracotta.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN RED CRUNCHY CLAY, BAKED BY TEH SUN 4 AGEZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give red_terracotta . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ STRIPEZ IN STRIPY HILLZ. WUT IZ 4 WARM COLOR WALLZ AN PATTURNZ. WIF ITZ COLOR COUZINZ, BIG PALETT 4 BILDIN. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, BIT HARDR DAN DIRTZ. PRO TIPZ EACH COLOR STAYZ AT TEH SAEM HEIGHT: FOLLOW TEH STRIPE. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A STRIPE 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"SANDZ","u":"blocks/strata/sand.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GOLDEN SANDZ, SOFT AN WARM. TEH KIND DAT MAEKZ U WANT 2 TAEK OFF UR SHOOZ. ALSO TEH BEST LITTR BOX EVR. IT IZ WER IT IZ HOT AN WER IT IZ WATUR. GUD 4 HOLIDAYZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give sand . IN TEH WURLD, IT COVRZ ALL OV HOT SANDZ (WIF SANDZ ROCK UNDR) AN TEH LANDZ STICKIN OUT OV BIG WATUR. IT ALSO MAEKZ TEH BEACHEZ AN TEH WATUR FLOOR NEXT 2 FLAT GRAS AN HOT SANDZ. WUT IZ 4 BEACHEZ, ZEN GARDNZ, GIANT SANDZ CASTLEZ. ALSO POKEY PLANTZ ONLY GROW ON SANDZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. 4 NAO SANDZ NO FALLZ : GRAVITEE NOT IN TEH WU"},{"t":"SANDZ ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/sandstone.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SANDZ ROCK IZ SANDZ DAT TOOK A LONG NAP AN GOT HARD. TEH SIDEZ HAZ PRETTY STRIPEZ, TEH TOP IZ SMOOF LIEK A TEMPUL FLOOR. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give sandstone . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ A LAYR OV A FEW BLOKZ RITE UNDR TEH SANDZ OV HOT SANDZ, BEFOR TEH ROCK. WUT IZ 4 HOT SANDZ HOUSEZ, PYRAMIDZ, BIG PILLARZ, BATHZ (KITTEH NO LIEK BATHZ). LOOKZ GUD WIF SANDZ AN POINTY TREE PLANKZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. TOP AN BOTTUM R DIFFRENT FROM SIDEZ: STRIPEY WALLZ, PLAIN FLOORZ. NOT LIEK SANDZ, IT WILL NEVR NEED HELP 2 STAY UP. PRO "},{"t":"SNOW BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/snow_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A BLOK OV SQUISHED SNOW, SUPR WHITE WIF LIL BLU SHINEZ. IT GOEZ CRUNCH JUS FROM LOOKIN AT IT. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give snow_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT SITZ ON TEH HIGHEST TOPZ OV BIG ROCKZ, ABOVE TEH NAKED ROCK. CAREFUL: COLD FLAT LAND HAZ SNOWY GRAS BLOKZ, NOT SNOW BLOKZ. WUT IZ 4 GIANT SNOWKITTEHZ, IGLOOZ, MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, OR FAKE TOPZ 4 UR OWN BIG ROCKZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO IT NEVR MELTZ, NOT EVEN IN HOT SANDZ. VERY STUBBORN SNOW. PRO TIPZ FLY 2 TEH TOP OV A BIG ROCK 2 SEE ITZ SNOW HAT. TEH VIEW IZ GR8"},{"t":"SNOWY GRAS BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/snowy_grass_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A GRAS BLOK WIF A WOOLY HAT: SNOW ON TOP, GRAS PEEKIN OUT OV TEH SIDEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. IT IZ COLD OUTSIDE BUT IT LOOKZ SO COZY. LIEK KITTEH IN A BLANKIT. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give snowy_grass_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH GROUND OV COLD FLAT LAND. NEXT 2 TEH FROZEN WATUR, TEH SHOREZ R CRUNCHY ROCKZ. WUT IZ 4 WINTR PIKCHURZ, MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, VERY EARLY HOLIDAY STUFFZ. TEH POINTY TREEZ OV COLD FLAT LAND GROW ON IT. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, SNOW ON TOP, SNOW-AN-GRAS SIDEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. 4 NAO TEH SNOW NEVR MELTZ AN NEVR SPREDZ: IT"},{"t":"ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/stone.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK IZ TEH BONEZ OV TEH WURLD: GRAY, STRONK, NEVR LETZ U DOWN. DIG THRU SUM DIRTZ OR SANDZ OR SNOW AN DERE IT IZ, GOIN DOWN 4 A LONG LONG WAY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV, IT WAITZ IN TEH NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR U TYPE /give stone . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH INSIDEZ OV EVRY BIOM, UNDR TEH TOP LAYR. ON TEH HIGHEST BIG ROCKZ IT POKEZ OUT IN TEH AIR, DEN SNOW TAKEZ OVR. DEEPR DOWN, IT BECOMEZ DEEP ROCK. WUT IZ 4 TEH BILDIN BLOK 4 EVRYTHIN: WALLZ, FLOORZ, TOWRZ DAT TICKLE TEH CLOWDZ. ALSO TEH IN TEH ROCK STRIPEZ LIVE IN IT. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. NO FALLZ, NO"},{"t":"TALL GRAS","u":"blocks/strata/tall_grass.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN LIL GRAS STIKZ POKIN OUT OV TEH GROUND. JUST TALL ENUF 2 TICKUL UR TOEZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give tall_grass . IN TEH WURLD, IT LIVEZ IN TUFTZ ALL OVR FLAT GRAS , LOTZ OF TREEZ AN SUMTIEMZ BIG ROCKZ , ON GRAS BLOKZ. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY GARDNZ, PRETTY GRAS, PRETTY PATHZ. MAEKZ UR HOUSE LOOK ALIVE. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, U SEE IT FROM ALL SIDEZ. NO BONK : U WALK THRU IT. NO HIDEZ OTHR BLOKZ. U CAN LOOK AT IT AN BREAK IT IN 1 HIT. NO GROWZ, NO SPREADZ. PRO TIPZ IT NO BLOCKZ ANYTHIN, SO PUT LOTZ AROUND UR HOUSE. U CAN "},{"t":"CRUNCHY CLAY","u":"blocks/strata/terracotta.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN CRUNCHY CLAY, BAKED BY TEH SUN 4 AGEZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give terracotta . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ STRIPEZ IN STRIPY HILLZ. WUT IZ 4 WARM COLOR WALLZ AN PATTURNZ. WIF ITZ COLOR COUZINZ, BIG PALETT 4 BILDIN. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, BIT HARDR DAN DIRTZ. PRO TIPZ EACH COLOR STAYZ AT TEH SAEM HEIGHT: FOLLOW TEH STRIPE. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A STRIPE 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"FIRE STIK","u":"blocks/strata/torch.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A WOOD STIK WIF A TINY FIRE ON TOP. EVRY XPLORR KITTEH NEEDZ IT: WER IT BURNZ, DARK AN CAVEZ GO AWAY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give torch . NOT IN NATURE. WUT IZ 4 MAEK CAVEZ, MINE HOLEZ, HOUSEZ AN PATHZ NOT DARK. LEEV SUM BEHIND U 2 FIND TEH WAY OUT. HOW IT ACTZ GIVEZ LITE LEVUL 14 (OV 15), 1 LESS EVRY BLOK, AN IT GOEZ AROUND STUFF. IT GOEZ THRU AIR, WATUR AN SEE-THRU BLOK, BUT NOT ROCK. IT IZ NOT SOLID. IT SITZ STRAIT ON A SOLID BLOK OR LEENZ ON A WALL , DEPENDZ WICH SIDE U LOOK AT; UNDR A ROOF IT FINDZ TEH FLOOR OR A WALL NEARBY. TAEK T"},{"t":"GREEN RUSTY ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/verdigris_rock.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GREY-GREEN ROCK, LIEK OLD COPPR ROOF. IT IZ WUT BIG COPPR STASHEZ R MADE OV. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give verdigris_rock . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ IN BIG COPPR STASHEZ, RARE AN FULL OV COPPR, LOTZ OV BLOKZ LONG. SUMTIMEZ A FEW BLOKZ POKE OUT ON TEH GROUND RITE ABOV. WUT IZ 4 BILDIN BLOK 4 NAO. COOL COLOR, SOFT. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. BIT HARDR DAN ROCK. PRO TIPZ GREENISH ROCKZ IN TEH GRAS OR SANDZ = BIG COPPR STASH UNDR. EZIER 2 SEE FROM FAR, FROM UP HIGH. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK 4 IT WEN U XPLORE: TEH GREEN IZ EZ 2 "},{"t":"DANGLY GREEN ROPE","u":"blocks/strata/vine.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A DANGLY GREEN ROPE UNDR TEH LEEFZ. LIEK A PARTY ROPE TEH FOREST FORGOTZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: PLANTZ TAB, OR /give vine . IN TEH WURLD, IT DANGLEZ 1 2 4 BLOKZ UNDR TEH HATZ OV BIG JUNGUL TREEZ AN SWAMP OAKZ. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY WALLZ, BRIDGEZ AN ARCHEZ. WILD GARDNZ. HOW IT ACTZ CRIS-CROS PLANT : 2 FLAT THINGZ CROSSIN, NO BONK (U WALK THRU). NO CLIMBIN YET. PRO TIPZ SUM DANGLY ROPEZ UNDR A BALCONY = OLD RUIN LOOK. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT IT 2 REED ITZ NAEM, OR OPEN TEH PLANTZ TAB IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX. WER IT SPAWNZ IN TEH PLANTZ: JUNGUL , STINKY WATUR HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"WATUR","u":"blocks/strata/water.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN TEH WATUR OV SEAZ AN LAEKZ AN BIG WATUR, BLU AN SEE-THRU. IT MAEKZ U WANT 2 JUMP IN, WILL HAZ FISHIEZ SUM DAY, AN IZ ALWAYZ PRETTY. KITTEH NO LIEK GETTIN WET THO. HOW 2 GETZ WATUR HAZ NO ITEM OV ITZ OWN : IN CREATIF, TEH BUKKIT OF WATUR (TOOLZ TAB) PUTZ A SAUCE WIF RITE CLIK, AN TEH EMPTY BUKKIT TAEKZ IT BAK. IN TEH WURLD, IT FILLZ ALL TEH LOW PLAECEZ UP 2 WATUR LINE, FROM BIG WATUR 2 TEENY LAEKZ IN FLAT GRAS. IN COLD FLAT LAND, TEH TOP IZ FROZEN. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY STUFFZ, NATURAL WALL, LANDMARK: TEH STARTIN PLAEC IZ ALWAYZ NEAR SUM WATUR. HOW IT ACTZ WATUR FLOWZ : A SAUCE (TEH WATUR"},{"t":"WHITE CRUNCHY CLAY","u":"blocks/strata/white_terracotta.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WHITE CRUNCHY CLAY, BAKED BY TEH SUN 4 AGEZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give white_terracotta . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ STRIPEZ IN STRIPY HILLZ. WUT IZ 4 WARM COLOR WALLZ AN PATTURNZ. WIF ITZ COLOR COUZINZ, BIG PALETT 4 BILDIN. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, BIT HARDR DAN DIRTZ. PRO TIPZ EACH COLOR STAYZ AT TEH SAEM HEIGHT: FOLLOW TEH STRIPE. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A STRIPE 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"YELLO CRUNCHY CLAY","u":"blocks/strata/yellow_terracotta.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN YELLO CRUNCHY CLAY, BAKED BY TEH SUN 4 AGEZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB, OR /give yellow_terracotta . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ STRIPEZ IN STRIPY HILLZ. WUT IZ 4 WARM COLOR WALLZ AN PATTURNZ. WIF ITZ COLOR COUZINZ, BIG PALETT 4 BILDIN. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, BIT HARDR DAN DIRTZ. PRO TIPZ EACH COLOR STAYZ AT TEH SAEM HEIGHT: FOLLOW TEH STRIPE. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT LOOK AT A STRIPE 2 REED ITZ NAEM AT TEH TOP. HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"BLOKZ","u":"blocks/index.html","s":"BILDIN BLOKZ FLAT TREE PLANKZ WHITE TREE PLANKZ BUKSHELF POINTY TREE PLANKZ SEE-THRU BLOK GLOWY ROCK JUNGUL PLANKZ GLOWY BOX OAK PLANKZ PRETEND DOOR 2 NOWHERE FIRE STIK NATURE STUFFZ FLAT TREE LEEFZ FLAT TREE LOG BOTTUM ROCK WHITE TREE LEEFZ WHITE TREE LOG BROWN SHROOM BLOK POKEY PLANT COAL IN TEH ROCK COPPR IN TEH ROCK COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK COPPR IN TEH DEEP ROCK SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK GOLD IN TEH DEEP ROCK IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK DEEP ROCK SHINY IN TEH ROCK DIRTZ RUSTY ROCK POINTY TREE NEEDLZ POINTY TREE LOG GOLD IN TEH ROCK GRAS BLOK CRUNCHY ROCKZ COLD WATUR BLOK IRON IN TEH ROCK JUNGUL LEEFZ"},{"t":"STRIPY HILLZ","u":"biomes/strata/badlands.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN HOT DRY STAIRZ HILLZ WIF RED SANDZ. EVRY SLOPE SHOWZ STRIPEZ OV CRUNCHY CLAY: ORANJ, YELLO, WHITE, RED. PRETTY. HOW 2 GETZ STRIPY HILLZ SHOWZ ON HIGH FLAT HILLZ IN HOT, DRY PLAECEZ. WUT IZ 4 RED SANDZ AN CRUNCHY CLAY IN 5 COLORZ, ALREDDY SORTED 4 U. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : RED SANDZ ON FLAT TOPZ, CRUNCHY CLAY STRIPEZ ON SLOPEZ AN UNDR (ABOUT 30 BLOKZ DEEP). PLANTZ : DED BUSHEZ, FEW POKEY PLANTZ. PRO TIPZ 4 1 COLOR, FOLLOW ITZ STRIPE: IT STAYZ AT TEH SAEM HEIGHT. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: TEH COLOR STRIPEZ R ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 "},{"t":"SANDZ SIDE","u":"biomes/strata/beach.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SOFT SANDZ BETWEEN TEH BIG WATUR AN TEH LAND. GUD 4 NAPZ IN TEH SUN. HOW 2 GETZ SANDZ SIDE IZ ON LOW COASTZ. NO SANDZ SIDE ON CLIFFZ. WUT IZ 4 SO MUCH SANDZ AN WATUR RITE THERE. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : SANDZ, DEEP. SANDZ UNDR TEH SHALLO WATUR. PLANTZ : NONE. ONLY A FEW BLOKZ ABOVE TEH SEA. PRO TIPZ WALK ON TEH SANDZ SIDE 2 GO AROUND AN ISLAND. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: SANDZ NEXT 2 WATUR IZ ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTNES +0.15 WETNES +0.00 LANDNES -0.30 SMOOTHNES +0.20 HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"LOTZ OF WHITE TREEZ","u":"biomes/strata/birch_forest.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN BRITE FOREST OV WHITE TREEZ, WIF FLOWRZ AN FERNZ. U NEVR GET LOST HERE. HOW 2 GETZ LOTZ OF WHITE TREEZ SHOWZ IN COOL, KINDA WET PLAECEZ. TEH WURLD CAN START U HERE. WUT IZ 4 WHITE TREE WOOD, FLOWRZ 2 PICK AN A CALM PLAEC 4 UR FIRST HOUSE. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS ON DIRTZ, SANDZ UNDR WATUR. PLANTZ : LOTZ OV WHITE TREEZ, FEW OAKZ, TALL GRAS, FLOWRZ, FERNZ. PRO TIPZ WHITE TRUNKZ R EZ 2 SEE FROM FAR. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: WHITE TRUNKZ R ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTNES -0.15 WETNES +0.15 LANDNES +0.20 SMOOTHNES +0.20 HISTOREE"},{"t":"DEEP BIG WATUR","u":"biomes/strata/deep_ocean.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SUPR DEEP WATUR FAR FROM LAND. DARK WATUR AN CRUNCHY ROCKZ AT TEH BOTTOM, MOAR DAN 40 BLOKZ DOWN. HOW 2 GETZ DEEP BIG WATUR IZ FAR OUT, AWAY FROM TEH LAND. WUT IZ 4 CRUNCHY ROCKZ, SO MUCH WATUR, AN FEELIN TINY. HOW IT ACTZ BOTTOM : CRUNCHY ROCKZ. WATUR : NO MOVE, SUPR DEEP. PLANTZ : NONE YET. PRO TIPZ DARKR BLU = DEEPR WATUR. ALSO ON TEH WURLD MAP. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: F3 SHOWZ HOW HIGH U IZ, AN TEH BOTTOM IZ FAR. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTNES +0.00 WETNES +0.00 LANDNES -0.85 SMOOTHNES +0.00 HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"HOT SANDZ","u":"biomes/strata/desert.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A SEA OV GOLDEN SANDZ UNDR A HUGE SKY, WER ONLY POKEY PLANTZ GROW. HOT SANDZ IZ HOT, DRY, AN SUPRIZINGLY CALM. ALSO TEH BIGGEST LITTR BOX EVR. BRING A HAT. HOW 2 GETZ HOT SANDZ SHOWZ IN HOT, DRY PLAECEZ, ON KINDA SOFT GROUND. WUT IZ 4 LOTZ OV SANDZ ROCK RITE UNDR TEH TOP, BIG EMPTY SPACEZ 4 GIANT BILDINZ, AN POKEY PLANTZ 4 DECORASHUN. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : SANDZ ON TOP, DEN SANDZ ROCK, DEN ROCK. PLANTZ : POKEY PLANTZ, ONLY ON SANDZ. SHOREZ : SANDZ, ON BEACHEZ AN UNDR WATUR. NO TREEZ, NO GRAS: U SEE TEH DIFFRENS FROM SUPR FAR. PRO TIPZ HOT SANDZ IZ PERFECT 2 TRY BILDINZ: OPEN GROUND,"},{"t":"FLOWR GRAS","u":"biomes/strata/flower_meadow.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GRAS WIF FLOWRZ OV ALL COLORZ EVRYWER. RED, YELLO, BLU, WHITE AN PURPL. BIG BOOKAY. HOW 2 GETZ FLOWR GRAS SHOWZ IN NOT-2-HOT PLAECEZ, NEXT 2 FLAT GRAS AN TREEZ. TEH WURLD CAN START U HERE. WUT IZ 4 SO MANY FLOWRZ 2 DECORAET, AN FLAT GROUND 2 BILD. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS ON DIRTZ, SANDZ UNDR WATUR. PLANTZ : LOTZ AN LOTZ OV FLOWRZ, TALL GRAS, SUM BUSHEZ, FEW TREEZ. PRO TIPZ PICK 1 OV EACH COLOR: DERE R 5. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: ALL TEH FLOWRZ R ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTNES +0.20 WETNES +0.05 LANDNES +0.20 SMOOTHNES +0.2"},{"t":"LOTZ OF TREEZ","u":"biomes/strata/forest.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN LOTZ AN LOTZ OV OAK TREEZ, SUPR GREEN. TEH TREE HEADZ ALMOST TOUCH AN U SNEAK BETWEEN TRUNKZ. IT SMELLZ LIEK MOSS, BARK AN ADVENCHUR. KITTEH HEAVEN. HOW 2 GETZ LOTZ OF TREEZ SHOWZ IN NOT-2-HOT, WET PLAECEZ, ON SOFT GROUND. WIF FLAT GRAS, WHITE TREEZ AN FLOWR GRAS, IT IZ ONE OV TEH BIOMZ WER TEH WURLD CAN START U. WUT IZ 4 INFINIT OAK LOGZ AN LEEFZ, AN TEH PERFECT PLAEC 4 A TREE HOUSE OR A FAIRY VILLAJ… DAT U MAEK UP. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS BLOKZ, DIRTZ UNDR, DEN ROCK. PLANTZ : LOTZ OV OAKZ, ALL SQUISHED 2GETHR. SHOREZ : CRUNCHY ROCKZ ON TEH SIDEZ AN UNDR TEH SHALLO WATUR. GOIN 2"},{"t":"JUNGUL","u":"biomes/strata/jungle.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN HOT THICK JUNGUL. HUEG TREEZ WIF FAT TRUNKZ, AN BUSHEZ, FERNZ AN DANGLY ROPEZ EVRYWER. HOW 2 GETZ JUNGUL SHOWZ IN HOT, WET PLAECEZ, FAR FROM TEH SEA. WUT IZ 4 SO MUCH JUNGUL WOOD (1 HUEG TREE FILLZ A BOX), DANGLY ROPEZ, AN TALL TREEZ 4 TREE HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS ON DIRTZ, CRUNCHY ROCKZ UNDR WATUR. PLANTZ : HUEG JUNGUL TREEZ, OAKZ, JUNGUL BUSHEZ, FERNZ, TALL GRAS, FEW FLOWRZ. LOTZ OV STUFF: U WALK SLOWR. PRO TIPZ CLIMB A HUEG TREE 2 SEE FAR. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: HUEG TREEZ AN BUSHEZ R ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. H"},{"t":"BIG ROCKZ","u":"biomes/strata/mountains.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SUPR HIGH POINTY TOPZ, DEEP VALLEEZ AN SNOWY TOPZ DAT SCRATCH TEH SKY. BIG ROCKZ IZ TEH BIOM 4 WOW VIEWZ AN BIG CRAZY PROJEKTZ. KITTEH LIEKS HIGH PLAECEZ. HOW 2 GETZ BIG ROCKZ POP UP IN TEH MIDDL OV TEH LANDZ, WER TEH GROUND IZ YUNG AN NOT WORN DOWN. DEY MAEK SHARP EDJEZ WIF WIDE VALLEEZ BETWEEN, AN DEY R TEH HIGHEST STUFFZ IN TEH WURLD BY FAR. WUT IZ 4 LOOKOUTZ, CASTLEZ ON CLIFFZ, TUNNELZ IN TEH ROCK, AN ROCK CLIFFZ WER IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ SUMTIMEZ SHOW. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS BLOKZ ON TEH SLOPEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. HOW HIGH : ABOVE SUM HEIGHT, GRAS BECOMEZ NAKED ROCK, AN EVEN HIGHR (A"},{"t":"SHROOM LANDZ","u":"biomes/strata/mushroom_fields.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WEIRD RARE PLAEC WIF PURPL SHROOM DIRTZ AN HUEG RED AN BROWN SHROOMZ. U FEEL TINY LIEK A BUG. HOW 2 GETZ SHROOM LANDZ R RARE : ONLY WER TEH LAND IZ SUPR WET AN SUPR FLAT, OFTEN NEXT 2 STINKY WATUR. WUT IZ 4 SHROOM DIRTZ, HUEG SHROOM BLOKZ AN A READY SHROOM HOUSE. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : SHROOM DIRTZ ON DIRTZ, DIRTZ UNDR WATUR. PLANTZ : HUEG RED AN BROWN SHROOMZ, LOTZ OV TINY SHROOMZ. PRO TIPZ IF U FIND 1, REMEMBR WER (F3). DEY R RARE. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: PURPL GROUND AN HUEG SHROOMZ R ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTNES +0.00 W"},{"t":"BIG WATUR","u":"biomes/strata/ocean.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WATUR, WATUR, AN MOAR WATUR. BIG WATUR GOEZ FAR AWAY FROM TEH LANDZ, DEEP AN BLU, WIF SUM LIL SANDZ ISLANDZ POKIN OUT. KITTEH SAYZ NOPE. HOW 2 GETZ BIG WATUR IZ IN TEH PLAECEZ FARRRST FROM TEH MIDDL OV TEH LANDZ, WER TEH GROUND GOEZ WAY UNDR WATUR LINE. WUT IZ 4 LONG TRIPZ, UNDR-WATUR BASEZ, LITE HOUSEZ ON LIL SANDZ ISLANDZ, AN SO MUCH CRUNCHY ROCKZ ON TEH FLOOR. HOW IT ACTZ WATUR : NO MOOVZ, UP 2 WATUR LINE. NO FLOWZ, U GO THRU LIEK AIR. FLOOR : A LAYR OV CRUNCHY ROCKZ, DEN ROCK. LANDZ ABOVE WATUR : SANDZ, ON TOP AN UNDR. PLANTZ : NONE, 4 NAO. DARK HOLEZ NEVR OPEN IN TEH SEA FLOOR"},{"t":"FLAT GRAS","u":"biomes/strata/plains.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN BIG BIG FIELDZ OV SOFT GRAS AS FAR AS U CAN SEE, WIF LONELY OAK TREEZ. FLAT GRAS IZ TEH BIOM 4 PIKNIKZ, LONG WALKZ AN FURST HOUSEZ. AN ZOOMIEZ. HOW 2 GETZ FLAT GRAS SHOWZ IN NOT-2-HOT, KINDA DRY PLAECEZ, ON SOFT GROUND. IT IZ ONE OV TEH BIOMZ WER TEH WURLD CAN START U (WIF LOTZ OF TREEZ, WHITE TREEZ AN FLOWR GRAS). WUT IZ 4 BEST GROUND 4 BILDIN: FLAT, OPEN, WIF JUS ENUF TREEZ 4 PRETTY. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS BLOKZ, DIRTZ UNDR, DEN ROCK. PLANTZ : A FEW OAK TREEZ HERE AN DERE. SHOREZ : SANDZ, ON TEH BEACHEZ AN UNDR TEH SHALLO WATUR. TEH EDJEZ WIF OTHR BIOMZ R SOFT: TOP BLOKZ MIX A"},{"t":"WIGGLY WATUR","u":"biomes/strata/river.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A LONG LONG RIBBON OV CALM WATUR GOIN WIGGLY BETWEEN TEH HILLZ, WIF PALE SANDZ ON TEH SIDEZ. WIGGLY WATUR GOEZ THRU OTHR BIOMZ AN NO ASKZ PERMISHUN. LIEK A KITTEH. IT TIEZ TEH LANDZ 2GETHR LIEK A BLU STRING. KITTEH WANTZ 2 PLAY WIF STRING. HOW 2 GETZ WIGGLY WATUR SHOWZ WERVR TEH GROUND IZ LOW ENUF, HOT OR COLD NO MATTR: IT GOEZ IN LONG WIGGLY LINEZ ACROS TEH LANDZ. TEH WIGGLY WATUR BIOM IZ ONLY TEH BOTTUM, UNDR TEH WATUR; TEH SIDEZ R OTHR BIOMZ. WHEN TEH GROUND GOEZ UP, WIGGLY WATUR GOEZ AWAY AN LEAVEZ ONLY A DRY VALLY IN TEH HILL. WUT IZ 4 A NATURE ROAD 2 EXPLOR AN NO GET LOST, WA"},{"t":"HOT GRAS","u":"biomes/strata/savanna.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN HOT DRY LAND WIF TALL GRAS AN FLAT TREEZ DAT LEAN. HOW 2 GETZ HOT GRAS SHOWZ IN HOT, KINDA DRY PLAECEZ, BETWEEN HOT SANDZ AN TREEZ. WUT IZ 4 ORANJ FLAT TREE WOOD, LOTZ OV SPACE AN A NICE VIEW. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS ON DIRTZ, SANDZ UNDR WATUR. PLANTZ : FEW FLAT TREEZ, LOTZ OV TALL GRAS, SUM BUSHEZ. PRO TIPZ FLAT TREEZ R EZ 2 SEE FROM FAR. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: TEH FLAT TREEZ R ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTNES +0.40 WETNES -0.20 LANDNES +0.25 SMOOTHNES +0.20 HISTOREE 0.2.0 ADDED"},{"t":"SNOWY POINTY ROCKZ","u":"biomes/strata/snowy_peaks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN TEH TOP OV TEH BIGGEST ROCKZ. SNOW ON FLAT BITZ, ROCK ON CLIFFZ, AN A WOW VIEW. HOW 2 GETZ SNOWY POINTY ROCKZ R ON TOP OV BIG ROCKZ, HIGHR DAN ABOUT 230 BLOKZ, BUT NOT IN TEH HOT PLAECEZ: DER TEH WARM BIG ROCKZ GO ALL TEH WAI UP. WUT IZ 4 SNOW BLOKZ, ROCK, AN TEH BEST VIEW EVR. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : SNOW ON FLAT BITZ AN SLOPEZ, ROCK ON CLIFF WALLZ. WATUR : COLD ICE ON TOP. PLANTZ : NONE. PRO TIPZ CLIMB UP TEH SOFT SIDE, NOT TEH CLIFF. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: SNOW ON TOP IZ ENUF. F3 SHOWZ HOW HIGH U IZ. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTN"},{"t":"COLD FLAT LAND","u":"biomes/strata/snowy_tundra.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A BIG FROZEN FLAT PLAEC COVRD IN SNOW, WIF A FEW SHIVERIN POINTY TREEZ AN LAEKZ DAT BECOME ICE MIRRORZ. COLD, QUIET, AN PRETTY LIEK A POSTCARD. KITTEH WANTZ HIZ BLANKIT. HOW 2 GETZ COLD FLAT LAND SHOWZ IN TEH COLDEST PLAECEZ, ON SOFT GROUND. WUT IZ 4 MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, IGLOOZ, WINTR VILLAJEZ, AN BIG FROZEN LAEKZ U CAN WALK ON. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : SNOWY GRAS BLOKZ, DIRTZ UNDR, DEN ROCK. WATUR : TEH TOP IZ FROZEN IN2 A LAYR OV COLD WATUR BLOK, WIF REAL WATUR RITE UNDR. PLANTZ : A FEW POINTY TREEZ HERE AN DERE. SHOREZ : CRUNCHY ROCKZ NEXT 2 WATUR. 4 NAO, SNOW NO MELTZ AN IT NO SNOWZ: EV"},{"t":"STINKY WATUR","u":"biomes/strata/swamp.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN LOW WET LANDZ. SHALLO WATUR WIGGLEZ BETWEEN TINY GRAS ISLANDZ, SQUISHY DIRTZ AT TEH BOTTOM. SWAMP OAKZ HAZ DANGLY GREEN ROPEZ AN SHROOMZ LUV IT HERE. HOW 2 GETZ STINKY WATUR SHOWZ IN WARM, SUPR WET PLAECEZ WER TEH GROUND IZ FLAT: IT SINKZ DOWN 2 TEH SEA. WUT IZ 4 LOTZ OV SQUISHY DIRTZ AN OAK, SHROOMZ 2 PICK, AN A GUD PLAEC 4 A HOUSE ON STIKZ. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS ON TEH ISLANDZ, SQUISHY DIRTZ UNDR TEH WATUR. WATUR : NOT DEEP (FEW BLOKZ MAX), IN PUDDLEZ. COLORZ : GRAS, LEEFZ AN WATUR LEAN OLIV GREEN, AN FOG PALE GREEN; TINTZ FADE SOFTLY AT BIOM BORDRZ (\"BIOM BLEND\" OPSHUN). PLA"},{"t":"LOTZ OF POINTY TREEZ","u":"biomes/strata/taiga.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN COLD FOREST OV POINTY TREEZ. TEH GROUND IZ BROWN NEEDLE DIRTZ, WIF FERNZ AN SHROOMZ. HOW 2 GETZ LOTZ OF POINTY TREEZ SHOWZ IN COLD, WET PLAECEZ. WUT IZ 4 LOTZ OV POINTY TREE WOOD, NEEDLE DIRTZ, SHROOMZ AN COZY CABIN VIBEZ. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : NEEDLE DIRTZ ON DIRTZ, CRUNCHY ROCKZ UNDR WATUR. PLANTZ : LOTZ OV POINTY TREEZ, FERNZ, TALL GRAS, TINY SHROOMZ. PRO TIPZ SHROOMZ LIEK 2 GROW NEXT 2 POINTY TREEZ. LOOK DOWN. HOW KITTEH FINDZ OUT NO BIOM NAEM ON SCREEN YET: BROWN GROUND AN POINTY TREEZ R ENUF. WEATHR WER TEH BIOME IZ ON TEH WEATHR MAPZ, -1 2 1. HOTNES -0.35 WETNES +0.35 LANDNES"},{"t":"TOASTY MOUNTINZ","u":"biomes/strata/warm_mountains.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN MOUNTINZ IN HOT PLAECEZ: GRAZZY SLOPEZ WIF FLAT TREEZ, DEN RED SANDZ AN BARE ROCKZ AT TEH TOP. DEY SIT BETWEEN COLD MOUNTINZ AN STRIPY HILLZ. HOW 2 GETZ TOASTY MOUNTINZ GROWZ INLAND, WERE TEH GROUND IZ YUNG AN POINTY, IN HOT, KINDA DRY PLAECEZ. WUT IZ 4 FLAT TREE WOODZ UP HIGH, RED SANDZ AN STONEZ, AN PRETTY VIEWZ OV TEH STRIPY HILLZ. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAZ ON LOW SLOPEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. HIGHNESS : ABOUT 165 BLOKZ, GRAZ TURNZ IN2 RED SANDZ , DEN ABOUT 200 BLOKZ, BARE STONEZ , ALL TEH WAI 2 TEH TOP: NO SNOW IN HOT PLAECEZ. PLANTZ : FLAT TREEZ, TALL GRAZ AN BUSHEZ ON TEH GRAZ, DED BUS"},{"t":"BIOMEZ","u":"biomes/index.html","s":"STRIPY HILLZ SANDZ SIDE LOTZ OF WHITE TREEZ DEEP BIG WATUR HOT SANDZ FLOWR GRAS LOTZ OF TREEZ JUNGUL BIG ROCKZ SHROOM LANDZ BIG WATUR FLAT GRAS WIGGLY WATUR HOT GRAS SNOWY POINTY ROCKZ COLD FLAT LAND STINKY WATUR LOTZ OF POINTY TREEZ TOASTY MOUNTINZ"},{"t":"/help","u":"commands/help.html","s":"/help [command] LISTZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ. UR SCREEN DOEZ IT. DESCRIPSHUN /help IZ TEH CHEAT SHEET OV TEH CONSOLE: IT LISTZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ, WIF HOW 2 TYPE DEM AN ONE LINE OV XPLAINZ. LOST, KITTEH? ALWAYZ START HERE. HOW 2 TYPE /help : SHOWZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ. /help <command> : SHOWZ ONLY DAT ONE (NO SLASH). EGZAMPLZ /help 4 TEH WHOLE LIST. /help time 2 REMEMBR TEH TIEM WORDZ. HOW IT ACTZ UR SCREEN DOEZ IT ALL ALONE, NO SERVR NEEDED, AN IT TALKZ IN TEH LANGWIJ U PIKD IN OPSHUNZ. IT WORKZ IN EVRY GAEM MOAD. A COMMAND NAEM DAT DOEZNT EXIST GIVEZ U NOTHIN. PRO TIPZ TYPE /help DEN PRES TAB: TEH CONSO"},{"t":"/tp","u":"commands/tp.html","s":"/tp <x> <y> <z> (~ = WER U R) ZOOPZ U (~5 = 5 BLOKZ MOAR). TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /tp ZOOPZ U RITE AWAY 2 EGZAKT NUMBRZ. GR8 4 EXPLORIN, FINDIN UR BILDIN AGAIN, OR VISITIN A BIG ROCK TOP U SAW FAR AWAY. HOW 2 TYPE /tp <x> <y> <z> . EACH NUMBR CAN B: A NUMBR (WIF DOTZ OK); ~ : WER U R NAO; ~ AN A NUMBR: THAT MUCH FROM WER U R ( ~5 , ~-10 ). EGZAMPLZ /tp 0 200 0 : GO 2 TEH MIDDL OV TEH WURLD, HIGH ABOVE TEH GROUND. /tp ~ ~20 ~ : GO UP TWENTY BLOKZ RITE HERE. /tp ~100 ~ ~ : LIL HOP 2 TEH EEST. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY . U ARRIVE FLYIN AN NOT MOOVIN: NO SUR"},{"t":"/give","u":"commands/give.html","s":"/give <item> PUTZ A THING IN UR BOX. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /give PUTZ A THING RITE IN TEH BOX U PIKD IN TEH BAR. FASTR DAN DIGGIN IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX WEN U ALREDDY KNOW TEH ID. GIMME GIMME. HOW 2 TYPE /give <item> , WER TEH ITEM IZ AN ID: FULL, WIF ITZ NAEMSPACE: strata:stone ; OR SHORT, 4 TEH BASIC STUFFZ: stone IZ SAEM AS strata:stone . EGZAMPLZ /give glass 4 A NU SEE-THRU BLOK. /give strata:fir_log 4 A POINTY TREE LOG. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY . TEH THING REPLAECEZ WUTEVR WAZ IN TEH BOX. WRONG ID? TEH CONSOLE SAYZ SO, NOTHIN CHANGEZ. SUM BLOKZ HA"},{"t":"/gamemode","u":"commands/gamemode.html","s":"/gamemode <creative|survival> CHANGEZ TEH GAEM MODE. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /gamemode CHANGEZ TEH GAEM MOAD OV TEH WURLD. IN V0.1 DERE IZ ONLY ONE MOAD, CRAYTIV , SO DIS COMMAND IZ MOSTLY WAITIN 4 TEH FUCHUR. LIEK A KITTEH WAITIN 4 DINNR. HOW 2 TYPE /gamemode <creative|survival> EGZAMPLZ /gamemode creative : GO (OR GO BAK) 2 CRAYTIV. /gamemode survival : TEH CONSOLE NICELY SAYZ SURVIVL COMEZ IN V0.3. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT. TEH MOAD IZ SAEVD WIF TEH WURLD AN SHOWZ IN TEH WURLDZ LIST. 4 NAO, ASKIN 4 SURVIVL CHANGEZ NOTHIN: TEH WURLD STAYZ CRAYTIV. PRO TIPZ U CAN ALS"},{"t":"/time","u":"commands/time.html","s":"/time <set|add|query> [value] SETZ TEH TIEM: set GOEZ 2 NEXT day, noon, night, midnight OR TICKZ; add SKIPZ DAT MANY TICKZ. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /time REEDZ OR SETZ TEH WURLD CLOK. EACH WURLD HAZ ITZ OWN TIEM, IT GOEZ 4WARD ALL ALONE WHILE U PLAI (NOT WEN PAWSD OR WIF /daycycle off ) AN IZ SAEVD WIF TEH WURLD. TEH SKY FOLLOWZ IT: SUN, MUN, SHINY DOTZ AN DAYLITE. HOW 2 TYPE /time <set|add|query> [value] query (OR NUTHIN): SHOWZ TEH TIEM NAO AN WICH DAI IT IZ. set <value> : GOEZ 2 TEH NEXT TIEM U ASK, WIF A WORD ( day RITE AFTR SUN COMIN UP, noon 4 MIDDL OV DAY, night RIT"},{"t":"/seed","u":"commands/seed.html","s":"/seed SHOWZ TEH WORLD SEED. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT. DESCRIPSHUN /seed SHOWZ TEH WURLD SEED: TEH LIL SEKRIT CODE DAT MADE ALL TEH GROUND. SAEM SEED, SAEM WURLD, EVRY TIEM. MAGIC! (NOT MAGIC. MATHZ.) HOW 2 TYPE /seed , NOTHIN ELSE. EGZAMPLZ /seed : TEH CONSOLE SAYZ TEH SEED, LIEK TEH WORD U TYPED WEN U MADE TEH WURLD. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT. IT IZ TEH ONLY COMMAND IN EVRY GAEM MOAD : KNOWIN UR SEED IZ NOT CHEETIN. IF U TYPED WORDZ AS TEH SEED, U SEE DEM WORDZ; IF NOT, U SEE TEH RANDUM NUMBR. PRO TIPZ SHARE UR SEED WIF UR FRENZ: IF DEY MAEK A WURLD WIF TEH SAEM ONE, DEY GETZ TEH EGZAKT SAEM PLA"},{"t":"/fluids","u":"commands/fluids.html","s":"/fluids [on|off|query|<budget>] MAEKZ WATR AN LAVA GO SPLOOSH OR STOP; A NUMBR SETZ HOW MANY UPDAETZ PER TICK, SHARD WIF FIER (1 FIER STEP IZ 3). TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /fluids MAEKZ TEH WATR AN LAVA GO SPLOOSH OR STOP, AN SETZ HOW MANY WET BLOKZ TEH SERVR UPDAETZ EACH TICK. TEH SETTIN IZ SAEVD WIF TEH WURLD; U CAN ALSO PICK IT WEN U MAEK TEH WURLD (TEH \"WATR AN LAVA\" BUTTN). HOW 2 TYPE /fluids [on|off|query|<budget>] on : WATR GOEZ SPLOOSH. off : WATR STAYZ STUK, RITE WER IT IZ. query (OR NUTHIN): SHOWZ TEH SETTIN NAO. <budget> : MAX WATR UPDAETZ PER TICK (2048 IF U NO S"},{"t":"/fire","u":"commands/fire.html","s":"/fire [spread|destroy] [on|off] OR /fire query LETZ HOT FIRE GO EVRYWHER OR NOT, AN NOM BLOKZ OR NOT. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /fire SETZ HOW HOT FIRE ACTZ IN DIS WURLD. TEH SETTIN IZ SAEVD WIF TEH WURLD; U CAN ALSO PICK IT WEN U MAEK TEH WURLD (TEH \"HOT FIRE\" AN \"BURNY\" BUTTNZ). HOW 2 TYPE /fire spread on|off , /fire destroy on|off , /fire query spread off : HOT FIRE NO MAEK NEW FIREZ; IT GETZ OLD AN GOEZ OUT WER IT IZ. destroy off : BURNY STUFF IZ NOT NOMMED (FIRE STILL GOEZ OUT IN TEH END). query (OR NUTHIN): SHOWZ BOTH SETTINZ. EGZAMPLZ /fire spread off : A FIREPLAYCE D"},{"t":"/daycycle","u":"commands/daycycle.html","s":"/daycycle [on|off|query] MAEKZ TIEM GO OR STOP. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /daycycle MAEKZ TEH TIEM GO ON OR STOP. TEH SETTIN IZ SAEVD WIF TEH WURLD; U CAN ALSO PICK IT WEN U MAEK TEH WURLD (TEH \"DAI AN NITE\" BUTTN). HOW 2 TYPE /daycycle [on|off|query] on : TIEM GOEZ ON, SUN AN MUN MOOV. off : TIEM STAYZ STUK (GUD WIF /time set 2 BILD IN SUNNY DAI 4EVR). query (OR NUTHIN): SHOWZ TEH SETTIN NAO. EGZAMPLZ /time set noon DEN /daycycle off : NOON 4EVR. /daycycle on : TEH DAI GOEZ ON AGAIN. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY . TIEM ALSO STOPZ WEN TEH GAEM IZ PAWSD. PRO TI"},{"t":"/cinematic","u":"commands/cinematic.html","s":"/cinematic <id> PLAYZ A MOOVEE. UR SCREEN DOEZ IT. DESCRIPSHUN /cinematic PLAYZ A MOOVEE: A CAMRA TRIP WRITTEN IN A PAK, DAT FLIEZ AROUND LIEK IN A FILM. TEH BASIC PAK HAZ ONE 4 SHOWIN OFF. POPCORN NOT INCLUDED. HOW 2 TYPE /cinematic <id> , WER id IZ TEH FULL ID OV TEH MOOVEE (WIF NAEMSPACE). EGZAMPLZ /cinematic strata:showcase : TEH CAMRA GOEZ UP AN SPINZ AROUND WER U R. HOW IT ACTZ UR SCREEN DOEZ IT ALL ALONE, IN EVRY GAEM MOAD. TEH MOOVEE STARTZ FROM WER U R : SAEM MOOVEE WORKZ EVRYWER. WHILE IT PLAYZ, U NO MOOV, TEH BUTTONZ GO AWAY 4 BLAK BARZ AN MAYBE WORDZ AT TEH BOTTUM, DEN U SEE FROM U"},{"t":"COMMANDZ","u":"commands/index.html","s":"OPEN TEH CONSOLE WIF T OR /. TAB FINISHEZ 4 U, UP/DOWN REMEMBERZ. /help LISTZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ. /tp ZOOPZ U (~5 = 5 BLOKZ MOAR). /give PUTZ A THING IN UR BOX. /gamemode CHANGEZ TEH GAEM MODE. /time SETZ TEH TIEM: set GOEZ 2 NEXT day, noon, night, midnight OR TICKZ; add SKIPZ DAT MANY TICKZ. /seed SHOWZ TEH WORLD SEED. /fluids MAEKZ WATR AN LAVA GO SPLOOSH OR STOP; A NUMBR SETZ HOW MANY UPDAETZ PER TICK, SHARD WIF FIER (1 FIER STEP IZ 3). /fire LETZ HOT FIRE GO EVRYWHER OR NOT, AN NOM BLOKZ OR NOT. /daycycle MAEKZ TIEM GO OR STOP. /cinematic PLAYZ A MOOVEE."},{"t":"HOW TEH WORLD IZ MADE","u":"mechanics/world-generation.html","s":"HOW IT WORKZ TEH WURLD IZ NOT DRAWED BY PAW: IT IZ CALCULATED FROM A SEED, BIT BY BIT WHILE U WALK. SAEM SEED, SAEM WURLD, BLOK BY BLOK, IN ANY ORDR. IT IZ KINDA INFINIT: ONLY TEH WURLD EDGE U PIKD STOPZ IT. GROUND AN BIOMZ 4 INVIZIBUL MAPZ COVR TEH WURLD: HOT OR COLD , WET OR DRY , HOW FAR FROM TEH SEA AN HOW WORN DOWN (FROM OLD FLAT LAND 2 YUNG LAND). TEH LAST 2 GIVE TEH GROUND HEIGHT: DEEP BIG WATUR, SOFT HILLZ, POINTY BIG ROCKZ. TEH GROUND IZ 3D NAO: CLIFFZ , ROCK ROOFZ AN ROCK BRIDJEZ WER TEH LAND IZ YUNG, STAIRZ HILLZ FAR FROM TEH SEA, AN WIGGLY WATUR DAT GOEZ AWAY UP HIGH AN LEAVEZ DRY "},{"t":"WET STUFFZ","u":"mechanics/fluids.html","s":"WUT IZ DIS WATUR AN HOT JUICE FLOWZ . EVRY WET STUFF HAZ SAUCEZ (TEH WATUR OV SEAZ AN LAEKZ, TEH HOT JUICE LAEKZ WAI DOWN) AN FLOWZ DAT GET MOAR AN MOAR THIN: DOWN FURST, DEN 2 TEH SIDEZ, 2 TEH CLOSEST SLOEP. IF WATUR SEEZ HOEL 4 BLOKZ AWAI OR LES, IT GOEZ ONLY DAT WAI: BROKEN LAEK = LIL STREEM GOIN DOWN TEH STAIRZ, NOT BIG FLOOD. NO HOEL? IT GETZ WIDE IN ALL 4 WAIZ. AT TEH BOTTOM OV FALL, WATUR IZ FULL AGAIN AN GOEZ AGAIN. 2 SAUCEZ NEXT 2 EACH OTHR ON GROUND OR SAUCE = 3RD SAUCE. WATUR GOEZ UP 2 7 BLOKZ ON FLAT GROUND, HOT JUICE ONLY 3, AN WAI SLOWR. TAEK AWAY TEH SAUCE AN TEH FLOW GOEZ AWAY."},{"t":"HOT FIRE","u":"mechanics/fire.html","s":"HOW IT WERKZ HOT FIRE IZ A BLOK OV FLAEMZ DAT GIVEZ LITE (LEVUL 15), GETZ OLD AN JUMPZ AROUND. IT SITZ ON A SOLID BLOK OR NEXT 2 A BURNY 1. EVRY STEP (A BIT MOAR DAN 1 AN A HALF SECONDZ), IT GETZ OLDR, MAI NOM A BURNY NAYBUR (SUMTIEMZ LEEVIN A FLAEM THAR) AN LITE TEH AIR AROUND, UP 2 4 BLOKZ HIGH, WEN DAT AIR TOUCHEZ SUMTHIN BURNY. OLDR FIRE = LESS JUMPIN; FIRE WIF NUTHIN 2 NOM GOEZ OUT SOON, AN EVRY BIG FIRE STOPZ BY ITSELF. SPARKY ROKZ (CRAYTIV) IN TEH TOOLZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, SPARKY ROKZ LITEZ A FIRE WIF A RITE CLICK ON TEH SIDE U LOOK AT, IF FIRE CAN SIT THAR (NOT NEXT 2 WATUR). T"},{"t":"DAI AN NITE","u":"mechanics/day-night.html","s":"WUT IZ DIS ON TERRA, A DAI IZ 20 MINUTZ : ABOUT 10 MINUTZ OV SUNNY AN 10 OV NITE, WIF A SHORT PINKY TIEM WEN SUN COMEZ UP AN GOEZ DOWN. TEH SUN COMEZ UP ON TEH EAST SIDE, CROSSEZ TEH SKY LEANIN A LIL 2 TEH SOUTH, DEN TEH MUN TAEKZ OVR. HOW LONG TEH SUNNY BIT IZ AN HOW DARK NITE IZ COMEZ FROM TEH PAK OV TEH PLACE, SO A PAK CAN CHANGE THEM. WUT U SEEZ TEH SKY GOEZ FROM SUNNY BLU 2 ORANJ AN DEN 2 DARK BLU NITE. TEH FOG AN TEH FAR EDGE FOLLOW. TEH SUN AN MUN R BIG CRISPY PIXELZ. TEH MUN HAZ 8 SHAEPZ , 1 PER DAI, FROM ROUND MUN 2 NO MUN AN BAK. SHINY DOTZ TWINKLE AT NITE AN GO AWAY NEAR TEH FAR EDG"},{"t":"NOIZEZ","u":"mechanics/sounds.html","s":"HOW IT WERKZ EVRY NOIZE IN TEH GAEM IZ MADE BY TEH GAEM ITSELF FROM RECIPEZ: FILTERD SHHH 4 SCUFFZ AN WINDY, TINY CRUNCHEZ 4 GRAVL, SNOW OR LEEFZ, RINGY BITZ 4 WUD, ROK, GLAS AN METUL, BUBBLEZ 4 WATUR AN HOT SOUP. EVRY NOIZE HAZ LOTZ OV FLAVURZ , AN EVRY TIEM IT GOEZ A BIT HIGHR OR LOWR: 2 STOMPZ NEVR SOUND TEH SAEM. WUT U HEERZ STOMPZ : DEY SOUND LIEK TEH BLOK UNDR UR PAWZ (ROK, DIRT, GRAS, SAND, GRAVL, SNOW, WUD, GLAS AN ICE, LEEFZ, METUL) AN GO FASTR WEN U RUN. BLOKZ GO BOOM AN PLOP : EVRY STUFF HAZ ITZ OWN; GLAS GOEZ CRASH. WATUR : SPLOOSH WEN U FALL IN, SWISH WEN U SWIM. HOT SOUP : TOP GO"},{"t":"FLOATEEZ","u":"mechanics/boats.html","s":"WUT IZ DIS A FLOATEE FLOATZ ON TOP OV WATUR AN HOT JUICE, AN NEVR SINKZ. IT COMEZ IN OAK , POINTY TREE , WHITE TREE , JUNGUL AN FLAT TREE : TEH BOAT IZ MADE OV TEH PLANKZ OV ITZ TREE. IN MAKIN MODE, DEY R IN TEH GO PLACEZ TAB OV TEH STUFF BOX. PUT, GIT IN, GIT OFF RITE CLIK WIF A FLOATEE ON WATUR (OR ON TEH GROUND): IT GOEZ DOWN, LOOKIN WER U LOOK. RITE CLIK ON A FREE FLOATEE: U SIT IN IT. TEH CAMRA FOLLOWZ TEH FLOATEE, U CAN STILL LOOK AROUND. SNEAK (KEY U CAN CHANGE, GAEMPAD 2): U GIT OFF, ON TEH SHORE NEXT 2 IT IF CLOSE, OR ELSE ON TOP OV TEH FLOATEE. TEH GAEM TELLZ U AT TEH BOTTOM OV TEH S"},{"t":"SAEVIN","u":"mechanics/saving.html","s":"HOW IT WORKZ EACH WURLD HAZ ITZ OWN FOLDR: ITZ PAPERZ (NAEM, SEED, MOAD, PLAI TIEM), UR KITTEH (WER U R, WER U LOOK, TEH BAR) AN A PIKCHUR 4 TEH WURLDZ LIST. TEH GROUND CAN B MADE AGAIN FROM TEH SEED, SO ONLY CHANGED PLAECEZ R SAEVD: A WURLD U WALKD A LOT BUT DIDNT TOUCH MUCH STAYZ TEENY. WEN TEH GAEM SAEVZ ALL ALONE , EVRY FEW MINZ (CHANGE IT IN OPSHUNZ → GAEM). WIF SAEV AN BAI , IN TEH PAWS MENU. WEN U CLOZE TEH GAEM WINDOW. ON TEH DS, WEN U CLOZE TEH LID : PAWS AN SAEV RITE AWAY. LIEK A KITTEH FALLIN ASLEEP MID-STEP. NO BROKD WURLDZ EVR EACH FILE IZ WRITTEN NEXT 2 TEH OLD ONE, DEN SWAPPD IN"},{"t":"GAEM MODEZ","u":"mechanics/game-modes.html","s":"HOW IT WORKZ TEH GAEM MOAD PIKZ TEH RULEZ OV A WURLD. U PIK IT WEN U MAEK TEH WURLD, IN TEH \"NU WURLD\" SCREEN, AN IT SHOWZ IN TEH WURLDZ LIST. IN V0.1, ONLY ONE MOAD: CRAYTIV . SURVIVL COMEZ IN V0.3. CRAYTIV MOAD TEH SANDBOX WIF NO RULEZ, 2 BILD AN EXPLOR AS U WANT: ALL TEH BLOKZ R IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, WIF TABZ AN SEARCH; U BREAK STUFFZ IN ONE CLIK , EVEN BOTTUM ROCK; U FLY WIF 2 QUIK JUMPZ; ALL TEH CONSOLE COMMANDZ R OK; U KNOW EVRYTHIN ALREDDY: NOTHIN 2 FIND OUT BEFOR U BILD. SURVIVL (COMIN SOON) PLANNED 4 V0.3. IT BRINGZ ITZ OWN RULEZ: COLLECTIN STUFFZ, TOOLZ, BLOK HARDNESS DAT REELY MAT"},{"t":"HOW STUFFS WORKZ","u":"mechanics/index.html","s":"HOW TEH WORLD IZ MADE WET STUFFZ HOT FIRE DAI AN NITE NOIZEZ FLOATEEZ SAEVIN GAEM MODEZ"},{"t":"HOW 2 MOOV","u":"controls.html","s":"KEYBORD, MOUSE AN GAEM PAD STRATA MUNDI WORKZ JUS AS GUD WIF KEYBORD AN MOUSE (NOM) AS WIF A GAEM PAD , AN U CAN SWITCH ANY TIEM. TEH HINTZ ON SCREEN FOLLO TEH LAST THING U TOUCHD: KEYBORD KEY OR GAEM PAD BUTTON. ANY KEYBORD TEH GAEM REEDZ WER TEH KEYZ R, NOT TEH LETTR ON DEM: ON A FRENCH AZERTY KEYBORD, WALKIN IZ ON Z, Q, S, D. BUT TEH TEXTZ SHOW TEH LETTR REELY ON UR KEY. TEH GAEM PAD BUTTONZ HAZ NEW 3DS NAEMZ (A ON TEH RITE, B AT TEH BOTTUM, X AT TEH TOP, Y ON TEH LEFT), SAEM AS TEH DS HANDHELD. LEFT STIK 2 WALK, RITE STIK 4 TEH CAMRA, WIF A DED ZONE U CAN CHANGE. ALL TEH MENUZ WORK WIF TEH"},{"t":"SETTINGZ","u":"settings.html","s":"OPSHUNZ 4 EVRY COMPUTR TEH GOLDEN RULE OV STRATA MUNDI: EVRYTHIN CAN B ON, OFF OR CHANGED . BIG FANCEH PC, OLD LAPTOP OR TEH DS HANDHELD: U CAN MAEK TEH GAEM FIT UR COMPUTR, UR EYEZ AN UR HABITZ. EACH OPSHUN HAZ A LIL LINE DAT SAYZ WUT IT DOEZ, AN HOW HEAVY IT IZ. PRESETZ A PRESET SETZ ALL TEH PIXELZ AT WUNCE: POTATO , SMOL , MEDIUMZ , FANCEH , ULTRA FANCEH , AN DS , MADE 4 TEH LIL HOMEMADE HANDHELD. IF U TOUCH ONE PIXELZ OPSHUN AFTR, U GO 2 MAH OWN , AN U LOSE NOTHIN. WORKZ RITE AWAY CHANGEZ WORK RITE NAO , NO RESTART: TEH GAEM ONLY REDOEZ WUT CHANGED (WURLD SHAPEZ, PIKCHURZ, WINDOW…). OPSHUN"}];
